{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}等一下  你发过誓
Wait! You swore!

879
01:37:15,980 --> 01:37:17,380
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}相信我
Trust me.

880
01:37:30,710 --> 01:37:32,330
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>窗台上的人</i>
<i>You at the window!</i>

881
01:37:32,420 --> 01:37:35,880
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>丢下武器  把双手放在头上</i>
<i>Drop your weapon and place your hands on top of your head!</i>

882
01:37:37,210 --> 01:37:39,050
