{\pos(97,10)\fscx50\an8}"备用能源"

986
02:05:14,110 --> 02:05:15,090
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

987
02:05:16,100 --> 02:05:17,100
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

988
02:05:17,480 --> 02:05:18,940
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}救命
Help!

989
02:05:21,100 --> 02:05:22,100
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

990
02:05:26,120 --> 02:05:27,120
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

991
02:05:30,100 --> 02:05:31,100
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

992
02:05:33,720 --> 02:05:34,720
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

993
02:05:35,980 --> 02:05:36,980
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

994
