{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}妈
Mom!

998
02:06:44,620 --> 02:06:45,740
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}趴下
Get down!

999
02:08:20,360 --> 02:08:22,530
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}起来  加油
Get up. Come on.

1000
02:08:24,780 --> 02:08:26,270
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}天呀
Holy shit.

1001
02:08:26,630 --> 02:08:28,630
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}我需要疗养
I need a vacation.

1002
