1020
02:10:12,670 --> 02:10:13,670
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}不
No!

1021
02:10:14,400 --> 02:10:15,860
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}不  等等
No, wait.

1022
02:10:15,940 --> 02:10:18,860
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}- 你不必这样做  - 抱歉
- You don't have to do this. - I'm sorry.

1023
02:10:19,780 --> 02:10:22,030
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}不  别这样  别走
No, don't do it! Don't go!

1024
02:10:22,110 --> 02:10:24,070
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}这一切必须结束
It has to end here.

1025
02:10:25,270 --> 02:10:26,770
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}我命令你不要走
I order you not to go!

1026
02:10:26,970 --> 02:10:28,470
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}我命令你不要走
I order you not to go!

1027
02:10:28,570 --> 02:10:29,770
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}我命令你不要走
I order you not to go!

1028
02:10:36,450 --> 02:10:38,750
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}我现在知道你们为什么会哭了
I know now why you cry.

1029
02:10:40,970 --> 02:10:43,430
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}但那是我永远做不到的事
But it's something I can never do.

1030
02:11:18,060 --> 02:11:19,640
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}再见
Good-bye.

1031
02:12:12,020 --> 02:12:15,070
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>不可知的未来在我们面前展开</i>
<i>The unknown future rolls toward us.</i>

1032
02:12:15,150 --> 02:12:19,070
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>我头一次充满希望的面对它</i>
<i>I face it for the first time with a sense of hope.</i>

1033
02:12:19,160 --> 02:12:21,490
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>全因为一台机器  一名终结者</i>
<i>Because if a machine, a Terminator...</i>

1034
02:12:21,570 --> 02:12:24,910
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>它学到了人类生命的价值</i>
<i>can learn the value of human life...</i>

1035
02:12:25,000 --> 02:12:26,660
{\pos(97,265)\fscx50}<i>也许我们也办的到</i>
<i>maybe we can too.</i>

1036
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:11,000
{\fs16\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}《终结者2: 审判日》 137分钟  剧场公映版
Terminator 2: Judgment Day (1991)
Theatrical Version
2 hr 17 min (137 min)

1037
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}卡 洛 克 影 业

