00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:38,100
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}亮 光 风 暴 娱 乐
联 合 制 片

1041
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:43,250
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}詹 姆 斯 · 卡 梅 隆
电 影 作 品

1042
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:54,100
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}洛杉矶  西元2029年

1043
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:10,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>30亿人死于1997年8月29日</i>
<i>Three billion human lives ended on August 29, 1997.</i>

1044
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:13,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这场核战的幸存者</i>
<i>The survivors of the nuclear fire...</i>

1045
00:02:13,250 --> 00:02:15,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>称这天为"审判日"</i>
<i>called the war "Judgment Day."</i>

1046
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:19,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>他们虽然活着  却得面对新恶梦</i>
<i>They lived only to face a new nightmare...</i>

1047
00:02:19,210 --> 00:02:21,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>打一场跟机器人的战争</i>
<i>the war against the machines.</i>

1048
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:43,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>电脑机器人的主宰者  天网</i>
<i>The computer which controlled the machines, Skynet...</i>

1049
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:46,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>派了两名终结者回到过去</i>
<i>sent two Terminators back through time.</i>

1050
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:50,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>它们的任务是消灭反抗军的领袖</i>
<i>Their mission: to destroy the leader of the human resistance.</i>

1051
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:53,310
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>约翰·康纳  我的儿子</i>
<i>John Connor, my son.</i>

1052
00:03:57,360 --> 00:04:01,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>1984年  第一个终结者想杀死我</i>
<i>The first Terminator was programmed to strike at me in the year 1984...</i>

1053
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:04,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>那是在约翰出生之前</i>
<i>before John was born.</i>

1054
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>但它失败了</i>
<i>It failed.</i>

1055
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>第二个则是试图</i>
<i>The second was set to strike at John himself...</i>

1056
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>杀害童年的约翰</i>
<i>when he was still a child.</i>

1057
00:04:14,670 --> 00:04:18,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>同上次一样  反抗军也派了一位勇士</i>
<i>As before, the resistance was able to send a lone warrior...</i>

1058
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:21,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>来保卫约翰</i>
<i>a protector for John.</i>

1059
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:25,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>问题是谁能先找到约翰</i>
<i>It was just a question of which one of them would reach him first.</i>

1060
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:31,400
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}阿 诺 · 施 瓦 辛 格

1061
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:37,400
