{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}编 剧
詹 姆 斯 · 卡 梅 隆
威 廉 · 威 舍 尔

1079
00:06:16,570 --> 00:06:20,090
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}制 片 及 导 演
詹 姆 斯 · 卡 梅 隆

1080
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:36,080
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"体格符合"

1081
00:08:39,490 --> 00:08:42,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我需要你的衣服  靴子  机车
I need your clothes, your boots and your motorcycle.

1082
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:53,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你忘记说"请"字了
You forgot to say please.

1083
00:09:10,190 --> 00:09:11,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}救我呀
Get him off me!

1084
00:09:32,750 --> 00:09:34,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把刀子拔出来
Pull it out!

1085
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快拔出来
Pull it out!

1086
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:56,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}拿去
Take it.

1087
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:25,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你不能这样一走了之
Can't let you take the man's wheels, son.

1088
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:28,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把机车留下  不然要你好看
Now, get off before I put you down.

1089
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:40,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这才像话  混蛋
That's it, goddamn it.

1090
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}六号报告
R-31 David, Sherman Code 6...

1091
00:11:42,970 --> 00:11:47,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}六街桥与圣塔菲之间有电流干扰
at the Sixth Street Bridge and Santa Fe on electrical disturbance.

1092
00:11:47,770 --> 00:11:50,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>10-4  R-31  D</i>
<i>Ten-four, R-31 David.</i>

1093
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:02,080
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"查询: 约翰·康纳"

1094
00:13:08,130 --> 00:13:10,230
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"白种男性  10岁"

1095
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:12,530
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"前科: 非法入侵  偷窃"

1096
00:13:12,730 --> 00:13:15,130
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"母亲: 莎拉康纳  父亲: 不详"

1097
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:18,030
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"法定监护人: 柏陶德夫妇"

1098
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:29,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  快进去把你的房间弄干净
John, get in there and clean up that pigsty of yours.

1099
00:13:41,430 --> 00:13:43,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她真是惹人烦  不是吗?
Your foster parents are kind of dicks, huh?

1100
00:13:43,930 --> 00:13:47,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我真受够了那可恶的小鬼
I swear, I have had it with that goddamn kid.

1101
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:49,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 他甚至不肯回我的话  - 你挡住电视了
- He won't even answer me anymore. - Honey, move.

1102
00:13:49,820 --> 00:13:52,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得帮我管教他
Would you get off your butt and help me?

1103
00:13:52,820 --> 00:13:55,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 陶德  - 什么事?
- Todd! - What?

1104
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:59,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他有一个月没整理房间了
He hasn't cleaned that room of his in a month.

1105
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:02,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}原来是急事  我这就去说说他吧
Oh, it's an emergency. Hang on. I'll get right on it.

1106
00:14:09,380 --> 00:14:11,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 走吧  - 约翰
- Come on. - John.

1107
00:14:12,090 --> 00:14:15,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}进去  照你妈的话做
Get your ass inside. Do what your mother tells you.

1108
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:19,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她不是我妈  陶德
She's not my mother, Todd.

1109
00:14:25,140 --> 00:14:27,120
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"州立精神病院"

1110
00:14:45,540 --> 00:14:47,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>下一位病人非常有趣</i>
<i>This next patient is interesting.</i>

1111
00:14:47,630 --> 00:14:50,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我观察这病例数年了
I've been following the case for years.

1112
00:14:50,170 --> 00:14:52,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}女性  29岁
A 29-year-old female...

1113
00:14:54,590 --> 00:14:57,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}诊断结果是精神不正常
diagnosed as acute schizo-affective disorder.

1114
00:14:57,340 --> 00:15:00,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她有一般的症状: 沮丧  焦虑  暴力倾向
The usual indicators: depression, anxiety, violent acting out...

1115
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:02,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}迫害妄想症
delusions of persecution.

1116
00:15:08,810 --> 00:15:12,190
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>但她的心态却非常独特</i>
<i>The delusional architecture is fairly unique.</i>

1117
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:15,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她相信一种叫终结者的机器
She believes that a machine called the Terminator...

1118
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这玩意儿的外形和人类相同
which looks human, of course,

1119
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:19,190
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它是乘时光倒流机回来杀她的
was sent back through time to kill her.

1120
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}蛮有独创性的
That's original.

1121
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:24,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她孩子的父亲也是乘倒流机
And also that the father of her child...

1122
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:27,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}回到今日来保卫她的一位战士
was a soldier sent back to protect her.

1123
00:15:27,420 --> 00:15:29,340
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他也是从未来回来的
He was from the future too.

1124
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:34,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我没记错的话  是2029年
The year 2029, if I remember correctly.

1125
00:15:34,130 --> 00:15:36,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们到了
And here we are.

1126
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>早安  莎拉</i>
<i>Morning, Sarah.</i>

1127
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:45,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}早安  索大夫
Good morning, Dr. Silberman.

1128
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:46,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你的膝盖还好吗?
How's the knee?

1129
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>很好  莎拉</i>
<i>Fine, Sarah.</i>

1130
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,700
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}数周前她夺走我的笔
She stabbed me in the kneecap...

1131
00:15:53,780 --> 00:15:57,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}攻击了我的膝盖骨
with my pen a few weeks ago.

1132
00:15:57,410 --> 00:15:58,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她曾多次意图脱逃
Repeated escape attempts.

1133
00:16:09,210 --> 00:16:11,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}咱们继续参观
Let's move on, shall we?

1134
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:14,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不喜欢病人把房间搞乱
I don't like to see the patients disrupting their rooms like this.

1135
00:16:14,930 --> 00:16:16,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}要确定她有服用镇定剂
See she takes her Thorazine.

1136
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没问题  索大夫  我会搞定她的
Sure, Dr. Silberman. I'll take care of it.

1137
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你是约翰·康纳的法定监护人?
Are you the legal guardian of John Connor?

1138
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:47,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是的  警员  他又惹祸了?
That's right, Officer. What's he done now?

1139
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我可以和他谈谈吗?
Could I speak with him, please?

1140
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他若在家  当然可以
You could if he were here.

1141
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但今早他骑车出去了
He took off on his bike this morning.

1142
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不知跑哪儿去了
He could be anywhere.

1143
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:55,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你有约翰的照片吗?
Do you have a photograph of John?

1144
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,210
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}有  等一下
Yeah. Hold on.

1145
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:02,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}能告诉我这是怎么回事吗?
Gonna tell me what this is about?

1146
00:17:02,470 --> 00:17:04,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我只想问他一些问题
I just need to ask him a few questions.

1147
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:08,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他长得真俊俏
He's a good-looking boy.

1148
00:17:08,220 --> 00:17:10,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我留着照片你不介意吧?
Do you mind if I keep this picture?

1149
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:11,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  当然不会
No, go on.

1150
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:13,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}今早也有个人来找他
There was a guy here this morning looking for him too.

1151
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:15,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  骑机车的大个子
Yeah, a big guy on a bike.

1152
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:18,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他跟这件事有关吗?
Has that got something to do with this?

1153
00:17:20,020 --> 00:17:21,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没有
No.

1154
00:17:21,740 --> 00:17:23,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不用管他
I wouldn't worry about him.

1155
00:17:24,910 --> 00:17:27,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}多谢你们的合作
Thanks for your cooperation.

1156
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:31,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}请插入金融卡
Please insert your stolen card now.

1157
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}密码是
PIN number.

1158
00:17:41,970 --> 00:17:43,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快点  搞太久了
Hurry up. This is taking too long.

1159
00:17:43,630 --> 00:17:45,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}加油
Go, baby.

1160
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:47,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好
All right.

1161
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:51,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 密码  9003  - 你这是跟谁学的?
- PIN number 9003. - Where'd you learn this stuff from?

1162
00:17:52,060 --> 00:17:54,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我妈  我亲生母亲
From my mom. My real mom, I mean.

1163
00:17:54,650 --> 00:17:58,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}提三百元
Withdraw 300 bucks.

1164
00:17:58,980 --> 00:18:01,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}来吧  宝贝
Come on, baby. Come on!

1165
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:04,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 好  - 成功了
- Yes! - Hey, it worked.

1166
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:07,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好  赚到了  走
All right. Easy money. Come on!

1167
00:18:10,330 --> 00:18:12,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}轻而易举
Yes! Piece of cake.

1168
00:18:17,710 --> 00:18:20,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 她就是你妈?  - 是的
- Is that her? - Yes.

1169
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她似乎很酷嘛
She's pretty cool, huh?

1170
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:25,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  她是个神精病
No, she's a complete psycho.

1171
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:28,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}所以才被人关在精神病院
That's why she's at Pescadero. It's a mental institute.

1172
00:18:29,130 --> 00:18:31,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她企图炸毁一间电脑工厂
She tried to blow up a computer factory,

1173
00:18:31,230 --> 00:18:32,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}结果遭击伤被捕
but got shot and arrested.

1174
00:18:32,810 --> 00:18:34,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真糟
No shit.

1175
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:37,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她是彻底的失败者
She's a total loser.

1176
00:18:38,030 --> 00:18:40,780
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走  咱们去花点钱
Come on. Let's go spend some money.

1177
00:18:55,690 --> 00:18:59,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>我的眼睛</i>
<i>It's like a giant strobe light...</i>

1178
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:02,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>感到一阵灼热感</i>
<i>burning right through my eyes.</i>

1179
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:08,580
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>但我似乎仍能看见</i>
<i>Somehow I can still see.</i>

1180
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:16,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>老天</i>
<i>Oh, God.</i>

1181
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:23,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>你们知道我的梦境每晚都一样</i>
<i>We know the dream's the same every night.</i>

1182
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:26,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>- 何必要...  - 请继续</i>
<i>- Why do I have to... - Please continue.</i>

1183
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:33,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>孩子们像纸一样的燃烧</i>
<i>Children look like burnt paper.</i>

1184
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:36,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>一片漆黑</i>
<i>Black.</i>

1185
00:19:36,950 --> 00:19:38,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>无人幸免</i>
<i>Not moving.</i>

1186
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:43,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>一切东西都被烧得面目全非</i>
<i>And then the blast wave hits them.</i>

1187
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:55,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>像树叶般四处散落</i>
<i>And they fly apart like leaves.</i>

1188
00:19:56,880 --> 00:20:00,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>你的梦把世界末日</i>
<i>Dreams of cataclysm, the end of the world...</i>

1189
00:20:00,350 --> 00:20:02,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>描述地很好</i>
<i>are very common.</i>

1190
00:20:03,970 --> 00:20:08,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这不是梦  这场核战是真的</i>
<i>It's not a dream, you moron. It's real.</i>

1191
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:12,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>- 我知道这一切将要发生  - 你的梦很有真实感</i>
<i>- I know the date it happens. - I'm sure it feels real to you.</i>

1192
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:14,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>1997年8月29日那天</i>
<i>On August 29, 1997...</i>

1193
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:18,410
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>你也会有完全一样的感受</i>
<i>it's gonna feel pretty fuckin' real to you too!</i>

1194
00:20:18,490 --> 00:20:22,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>没有擦几万层防晒油的人都会很惨的</i>
<i>Anybody not wearing two-million sunblock is gonna have a real bad day.</i>

1195
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>- 懂吗?  - 别激动</i>
<i>- Get it? - Stop.</i>

1196
00:20:24,250 --> 00:20:27,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>你们无能为力</i>
<i>God, you think you're safe and alive.</i>

1197
00:20:27,210 --> 00:20:29,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>你们都会死掉</i>
<i>You're already dead. Everybody!</i>

1198
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:32,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>听好  你们都会死掉</i>
<i>Him. You. You're dead already.</i>

1199
00:20:32,170 --> 00:20:35,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这儿的一切将消失无踪</i>
<i>This whole place, everything you see is gone!</i>

1200
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:39,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>做梦的人是你们  我保证  你们若再不清醒</i>
<i>You're the one living in the dream, 'cause I know it happens!</i>

1201
00:20:39,300 --> 00:20:41,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>就"美梦"成真了</i>
<i>It happens!</i>

1202
00:20:52,230 --> 00:20:55,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我现在好多了
I feel much better now.

1203
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}清醒了
Clearer.

1204
00:20:57,280 --> 00:21:00,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没错  你最近的态度
Yes, your attitude has been...

1205
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:02,450
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}的确改善不少
much improved lately.

1206
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:14,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你说我的生活应该有个目标
It's helped me to have a goal...

1207
00:21:14,380 --> 00:21:17,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}找件我很希望做的事
something to look forward to.

1208
00:21:17,630 --> 00:21:18,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}什么事?
What is that?

1209
00:21:18,890 --> 00:21:21,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你说过
Well, you said...

1210
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:25,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的病情若有改善
that if I showed improvement after six months...

1211
00:21:25,230 --> 00:21:27,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你会送我到管理较松的医院
you would transfer me to the minimum security wing...

1212
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:30,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}而且可以让我会客
and I could have visitors.

1213
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:36,400
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在已经过去六个月了
Well, it's been six months and...

1214
00:21:37,530 --> 00:21:39,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我很想见见我儿子
I was looking forward to seeing my son.

1215
00:21:40,870 --> 00:21:42,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我明白了
I see.

1216
00:21:45,580 --> 00:21:49,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}咱们再谈谈你提到的终结者机器
Let's go back to what you were saying about those Terminator machines.

1217
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:54,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你现在认为它们不存在了?
Now you think they don't exist?

1218
00:21:54,380 --> 00:21:58,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它们不存在  我现在知道了
They don't exist. I know that now.

1219
00:21:58,590 --> 00:22:01,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你反覆提及砸烂过一个终结者
But you've told me on many occasions about how you crushed one...

1220
00:22:01,850 --> 00:22:03,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那又怎么解释
in a hydraulic press.

1221
00:22:05,310 --> 00:22:08,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我若做过这事  应该会有证据留下
If I had, there would have been some evidence.

1222
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:10,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他们应该会在那工厂找到残骸
They would have found something at the factory.

1223
00:22:11,020 --> 00:22:13,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我懂了
I see.

1224
00:22:13,190 --> 00:22:16,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>你不认为电脑公司掩饰了一切?</i>
<i>So you don't believe anymore that the company covered it up?</i>

1225
00:22:18,910 --> 00:22:21,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>不  它们为何要如此?</i>
<i>No. Why would they?</i>

1226
00:22:21,990 --> 00:22:25,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 换个位置  - 好
- Let's try a new position right there. - Okay.

1227
00:22:25,690 --> 00:22:29,670
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}所有感应系统运作正常

1228
00:22:29,740 --> 00:22:31,730
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}对  这是新的零件

1229
00:22:32,750 --> 00:22:34,730
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}线路有点故障

1230
00:22:35,050 --> 00:22:36,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}戴森先生
Mr. Dyson?

1231
00:22:38,430 --> 00:22:41,060
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}材料小组准备要...
The materials team is running another...

1232
00:22:41,140 --> 00:22:42,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 戴森先生  - 怎么啦?
- Mr. Dyson. - Yes?

1233
00:22:42,890 --> 00:22:45,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}材料小组下午要做实验
The materials team is running another series this afternoon.

1234
00:22:45,940 --> 00:22:48,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得签字同意
You have to sign for the... it.

1235
00:22:48,980 --> 00:22:51,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 把"它"拿出来  - 好的  我懂了
- You have to sign it out. - Okay. I'll get it.

1236
00:22:53,650 --> 00:22:54,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}戴森先生
Listen, Mr. Dyson,

1237
00:22:54,780 --> 00:22:56,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我知道我刚进公司
I know I haven't been here long,

1238
00:22:56,050 --> 00:22:57,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但你是否可以告诉我...
but I was wondering if you know...

1239
00:22:57,890 --> 00:22:59,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}告诉你什么?
Know what?

1240
00:22:59,370 --> 00:23:02,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你知不知道"它"是哪儿来的?
If you know where "it" came from.

1241
00:23:02,050 --> 00:23:03,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我也问过这个问题  
I asked them the same question once.

1242
00:23:03,850 --> 00:23:05,450
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他们的回答是
You know what they told me?

1243
00:23:05,450 --> 00:23:07,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"别问"
Don't ask.

1244
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:14,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你好  戴森先生
Good morning, Mr. Dyson.

1245
00:23:14,300 --> 00:23:16,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 还好吗?  - 还好
- How's it going? - Okay.

1246
00:23:16,590 --> 00:23:19,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}插入钥匙  左向  三
Insert key. Left on three.

1247
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:21,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}二  一  转
Two, one, turn.

1248
00:23:25,020 --> 00:23:26,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你老婆孩子还好吧  - 很好  谢谢
- How are the wife and kids? - Great. Thanks.

1249
00:23:26,750 --> 00:23:27,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好了
Here you go.

1250
00:23:55,470 --> 00:23:58,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你觉得如何  大夫?
So what do you think, Doctor?

1251
00:23:59,390 --> 00:24:01,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我有进步  是吧?
Haven't I shown improvement?

1252
00:24:02,600 --> 00:24:05,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}莎拉  问题是
Well, Sarah, here's the problem.

1253
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:08,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我知道你有多聪明
I know how smart you are.

1254
00:24:08,980 --> 00:24:11,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你是挑我爱听的讲
You're just telling me what I want to hear.

1255
00:24:12,070 --> 00:24:15,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我认为你根本言不由衷
I don't think you really believe what you're telling me today.

1256
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:19,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你想调到管理宽松的医院  只是想逃
If I put you in minimum security, you'll just try to escape again.

1257
00:24:23,960 --> 00:24:26,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得让我看看我儿子
You have to let me see my son.

1258
00:24:27,500 --> 00:24:29,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}求求你
Please.

1259
00:24:30,740 --> 00:24:31,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}求求你
Please.

1260
00:24:33,050 --> 00:24:36,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他有生命危险  他需要我帮助
He's in great danger. He's naked without me.

1261
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:39,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}让我打个电话也行
If I could make a phone call...

1262
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:41,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不行  一会儿也不行
I'm afraid not. Not for a while.

1263
00:24:43,890 --> 00:24:46,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我别无选择
I don't see any choice but to recommend to the review board...

1264
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:49,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}只好再关你半年
that you stay here for another six months.

1265
00:24:52,190 --> 00:24:55,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我要杀了你  混蛋
I'll kill you, you son of a bitch!

1266
00:24:56,530 --> 00:24:59,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你这禽兽  - 抓住她
- You son of a bitch! - Get her off!

1267
00:24:59,990 --> 00:25:02,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}给她打镇静剂
Ten CCs of sodium amobarbital, stat!

1268
00:25:03,750 --> 00:25:05,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们这些混蛋
You don't know what you're doing!

1269
00:25:05,150 --> 00:25:06,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快拿药来
Get some restraints in here now!

1270
00:25:08,790 --> 00:25:12,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}死到临头了还不觉悟
You don't know what you're doing!

1271
00:25:16,220 --> 00:25:18,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>真是个模范公民</i>
<i>Model citizen.</i>

1272
00:25:39,740 --> 00:25:41,040
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"目标确认"

1273
00:25:57,550 --> 00:26:00,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你刚好错过  15分钟前他们刚走
You just missed him. He was here 15 minutes ago.

1274
00:26:00,350 --> 00:26:03,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 他们好像要去加利瑞购物中心  - 对
- He was going to the galleria. - Yeah.

1275
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:05,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}加利瑞?
The galleria?

1276
00:26:50,610 --> 00:26:53,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 我去换些铜板  马上回来  - 好
- I'm gonna get some quarters. I'll be back, all right? - Cool.

1277
00:27:08,710 --> 00:27:11,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 噢  不  - 小姑娘  你们认识约翰·康纳吗?
- Oh, no! - Girls, do you know John Connor?

1278
00:27:11,740 --> 00:27:12,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不认识
No.

1279
00:27:15,300 --> 00:27:18,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}嘿  你认识这个孩子吗?
Hey, do you know this kid?

1280
00:27:18,140 --> 00:27:20,310
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  我不认识他
Nah, I don't know him.

1281
00:27:25,650 --> 00:27:28,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 约翰  - 现在不行
- John. - Not now.

1282
00:27:28,110 --> 00:27:31,360
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}有个条子在找你  快瞧
There's this cop scoping for you. Check it out.

1283
00:27:33,900 --> 00:27:35,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 他就在那边  - 快溜
- He's right over there. - Split, man.

1284
00:27:35,910 --> 00:27:38,370
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 快走  - 好
- Just go. - Yeah.

1285
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你在找的人好像往那儿...
I saw that kid...

1286
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}嘿  你不能跑到这里来
Hey! You're not supposed to be in here!

1287
00:28:27,340 --> 00:28:28,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴下
Get down.

1288
00:29:39,330 --> 00:29:41,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}先生  你没事吧?
Mister, are you all right?

1289
00:29:42,670 --> 00:29:43,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你没事吧?
You all right?

1290
00:29:59,140 --> 00:30:00,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快啊
Come on!

1291
00:30:40,230 --> 00:30:41,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}该死
Goddamn!

1292
00:35:20,810 --> 00:35:23,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}靠到路边  停车
Okay, time-out. Stop the bike.

1293
00:35:23,610 --> 00:35:26,190
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}停下来
Time-out. Come on, stop the bike.

1294
00:35:39,290 --> 00:35:42,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天啊  别会错意了
Holy shit. Now, don't take this the wrong way.

1295
00:35:42,080 --> 00:35:44,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你是终结者  对吧?  - 对
- You are a Terminator, right? - Yes.

1296
00:35:44,550 --> 00:35:47,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}生化机械  模型101
Cyberdyne Systems, Model 101.

1297
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:48,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不可能吧
No.

1298
00:35:58,980 --> 00:36:00,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好家伙
Holy shit.

1299
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:04,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你真像真的人
You're really real.

1300
00:36:05,070 --> 00:36:07,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我是说
I mean...

1301
00:36:09,530 --> 00:36:12,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你骨子里是机器人  对吧?
You're like a machine underneath, right?

1302
00:36:12,570 --> 00:36:14,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}可外表是人形
But alive outside?

1303
00:36:14,160 --> 00:36:16,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}内部是机械骨架
I'm a cybernetic organism.

1304
00:36:16,160 --> 00:36:18,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}外部是真皮
Living tissue over metal endoskeleton.

1305
00:36:33,680 --> 00:36:35,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真帅
This is intense.

1306
00:36:35,930 --> 00:36:38,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  清醒一下
Get a grip, John. Okay.

1307
00:36:41,310 --> 00:36:43,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你不是来杀我的
You're not here to kill me.

1308
00:36:43,520 --> 00:36:47,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这一点我知道  那你到底要怎样?
I figured that part out for myself. So what's the deal?

1309
00:36:47,570 --> 00:36:49,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的任务是要保护你
My mission is to protect you.

1310
00:36:50,470 --> 00:36:53,290
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是吗?  谁派你来的?
Yeah? Who sent you?

1311
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:56,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是你  35年后的你
You did. Thirty-five years from now...

1312
00:36:56,410 --> 00:37:00,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}派我来保护现在的你
you reprogrammed me to be your protector here in this time.

1313
00:37:00,500 --> 00:37:03,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真深奥
Oh, this is deep.

1314
00:37:05,420 --> 00:37:08,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那家伙跟你一样是终结者?
So this other guy, he's a Terminator like you, right?

1315
00:37:08,220 --> 00:37:12,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}跟我不同  它是T-1000  是更先进的模型
Not like me. A T-1000, advanced prototype.

1316
00:37:13,820 --> 00:37:15,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你是说它比你更先进?
Your mean more advanced than you are?

1317
00:37:15,720 --> 00:37:20,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 对  它是特种合金制造  - 那是什么意思?
- Yes. A mimetic poly-alloy. - What the hell does that mean?

1318
00:37:20,310 --> 00:37:24,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 液态金属  - 我们去哪儿?
- Liquid metal. - Where are we going?

1319
00:37:24,650 --> 00:37:27,990
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得立刻离开这座城市  这样才能逃避它的追杀
We have to get out of the city immediately and avoid the authorities.

1320
00:37:28,070 --> 00:37:31,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我想回家去  收拾些东西再走
I gotta stop by my house. I wanna pick up some stuff.

1321
00:37:31,260 --> 00:37:35,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}否决  T-1000它一定会在那等你的
Negative. The T-1000 would definitely try to reacquire you there.

1322
00:37:35,750 --> 00:37:38,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你确定?  - 我确定
- You sure? - I would.

1323
00:37:49,090 --> 00:37:51,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}陶德和吉纳会有危险
Look, Todd and Janelle are dicks...

1324
00:37:54,060 --> 00:37:55,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我至少得警告他们
but I gotta warn 'em.

1325
00:37:55,600 --> 00:37:57,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}可恶  你有铜板吗?
Shit. You got a quarter?

1326
00:38:06,740 --> 00:38:09,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 喂  <i>- 吉纳  是我</i>
- Hello. <i>- Janelle, it's me.</i>

1327
00:38:09,820 --> 00:38:12,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 约翰?  <i>- 一切都好吗?</i>
- John? <i>- Is everything all right?</i>

1328
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:14,700
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你们都没事吧?  <i>- 当然  甜心  一切都很好</i>
- Are you guys okay? <i>- Sure, honey, everything's okay.</i>

1329
00:38:14,790 --> 00:38:17,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你没事吧?  <i>- 我很好</i>
- Are you all right? <i>- Yeah, I'm fine.</i>

1330
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:21,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  天晚了  我很担心你
John, it's late. I was beginning to worry about you.

1331
00:38:21,630 --> 00:38:24,340
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你赶快回来  我们一起吃晚餐
If you hurry home, we can sit down and have dinner together.

1332
00:38:24,420 --> 00:38:25,970
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我正在煮牛肉呢
I'm making beef stew.

1333
00:38:26,050 --> 00:38:28,310
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不对劲  她对我从没这么好过
Somethings wrong. She's never this nice.

1334
00:38:28,390 --> 00:38:30,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  你在哪儿?
John? Where are you?

1335
00:38:30,930 --> 00:38:33,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那只狗在鬼叫什么劲?
What the hell is the goddamn dog barking at?

1336
00:38:33,890 --> 00:38:37,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}闭嘴  你这一文不值的废物
Hey, shut up, you worthless piece of shit!

1337
00:38:37,230 --> 00:38:38,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}狗在吠叫
The dog's really barking.

1338
00:38:38,770 --> 00:38:41,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}叫那小鬼把那杂种狗丢掉
You were gonna tell the kid to get rid of that mutt.

1339
00:38:44,900 --> 00:38:47,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  天晚了  别害我担心
John, it's late. Please don't make me worry.

1340
00:38:47,740 --> 00:38:49,450
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他已经在那里了吗?
Could he already be there?

1341
00:38:50,570 --> 00:38:51,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}甜心  你没事吧
Honey, are you okay?

1342
00:38:51,950 --> 00:38:55,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 我在这儿  我没事  <i>- 真的吗?</i>
- I'm right here. I'm fine. <i>- Are you sure you're all right?</i>

1343
00:38:56,040 --> 00:38:59,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 狗叫什么名字?  - 麦克斯
- What's the dog's name? - Max.

1344
00:38:59,460 --> 00:39:01,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}吉纳  伍飞怎么了?
Hey, Janelle. What's wrong with Wolfie?

1345
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:04,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我听见它在叫  它没事吧?
I can hear him barking. Is he okay?

1346
00:39:04,550 --> 00:39:08,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}伍飞很好  甜心  它很好
Wolfie's fine, honey. Wolfie's just fine.

1347
00:39:08,510 --> 00:39:09,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你在哪儿?
Where are you?

1348
00:39:11,730 --> 00:39:13,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你的养父母都死了
Your foster parents are dead.

1349
00:39:50,720 --> 00:39:52,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}说清楚点
I need a minute here.

1350
00:39:52,810 --> 00:39:57,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你说这机器能模仿一切事物?
You're telling me that this thing can imitate anything it touches?

1351
00:39:57,230 --> 00:40:00,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}只要它能接触到的都行
Anything it samples by physical contact.

1352
00:40:00,230 --> 00:40:01,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}厉害
Get real.

1353
00:40:01,730 --> 00:40:05,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那它也能变成一包香烟?
It could disguise itself as a pack of cigarettes?

1354
00:40:05,570 --> 00:40:07,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不行  只能变成类似它大小的物体
No, only an object of equal size.

1355
00:40:07,570 --> 00:40:10,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那为何不变成颗炸弹来杀我?
Why not just become a bomb or something to get me?

1356
00:40:10,250 --> 00:40:12,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它无法变成很复杂的机器
It can't form complex machines.

1357
00:40:12,310 --> 00:40:14,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}像枪枝  炸药  化学品等
Guns and explosives have chemicals, moving parts.

1358
00:40:14,560 --> 00:40:18,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但它可以变出一个固态金属形状
It doesn't work that way. But it can form solid metal shapes.

1359
00:40:18,210 --> 00:40:21,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 像是什么?  - 像刀  能刺的武器
- Like what? - Knives and stabbing weapons.

1360
00:40:22,050 --> 00:40:25,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这些是电视监视器照的
These were taken by a video surveillance camera...

1361
00:40:25,090 --> 00:40:28,590
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}1984年  在西城警局
at the West Highland Police Station in 1984.

1362
00:40:29,390 --> 00:40:31,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那晚他杀了17名警察
He killed 17 police officers that night.

1363
00:40:33,810 --> 00:40:35,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}都是有家室的人
Men with families...

1364
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}有子女
children.

1365
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:42,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这是今天在一个购物中心照的
These were taken at a mall in Reseda...

1366
00:40:42,940 --> 00:40:45,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}就在今天
today.

1367
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:49,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}康纳小姐  我们知道你认得此人
Miss Connor, we know you know who this guy is.

1368
00:40:52,950 --> 00:40:56,710
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我还要告诉你  令郞也失踪了
I just sat here and told you that your son is missing...

1369
00:40:56,790 --> 00:40:59,630
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他的养父母双双遇害
that the foster parents have been murdered.

1370
00:40:59,690 --> 00:41:01,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们知道此人涉有重嫌
We know this guy's involved.

1371
00:41:02,500 --> 00:41:05,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}此事你一点也不关心?  你关心吗?
Doesn't that mean anything to you? Don't you care?

1372
00:41:10,720 --> 00:41:14,210
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们是在浪费时间  咱们走
We're wasting our time. Let's go.

1373
00:41:14,470 --> 00:41:16,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抱歉各位
Sorry, guys.

1374
00:41:17,100 --> 00:41:21,400
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她越来越与现实生活脱节了
She's grown more disconnected from reality as time goes on.

1375
00:41:21,480 --> 00:41:23,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}恐怕她帮不了你们的忙
I'm afraid she can't help us now.

1376
00:41:23,780 --> 00:41:26,990
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}也许等她神智清醒时就可以了  我会通知你们的
If she clears at all and can give us anything, I'll call you.

1377
00:41:27,070 --> 00:41:28,700
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好吧
Sure.

1378
00:41:28,780 --> 00:41:31,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}道格  请带她回房去
Douglas, take her back to her room, please.

1379
00:41:31,850 --> 00:41:32,990
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是
Yes, sir.

1380
00:41:34,540 --> 00:41:36,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们走
Come on, sweetheart. Let's go.

1381
00:41:36,870 --> 00:41:38,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好长一段时间
You see...

1382
00:41:38,880 --> 00:41:42,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们曾在尼加拉瓜或其他的地方待过
we spent a lot of time in Nicaragua and places like that.

1383
00:41:43,340 --> 00:41:47,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她有阵子跟退役的绿色贝雷帽士兵混
For a while there, she was with this crazy ex-Green Beret guy...

1384
00:41:47,760 --> 00:41:49,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}弄了不少枪
running guns.

1385
00:41:49,220 --> 00:41:52,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}然后又找了些人
Then there were some other guys.

1386
00:41:52,220 --> 00:41:54,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她向任何可以学习的人吸取经验
She'd shack up with anybody she could learn from...

1387
00:41:54,310 --> 00:41:57,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}以便将我造就成伟大的军事领袖
so she could teach me how to be this great military leader.

1388
00:41:59,310 --> 00:42:01,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}后来她被捕了
Then she gets busted.

1389
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:05,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我妈疯狂的举动把我也弄糊涂了
It's like, "Sorry, kid, your mom's a psycho. Didn't you know?"

1390
00:42:07,240 --> 00:42:11,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好像她教我相信的一切是狗屎
Like everything I've been brought up to believe is all made-up bullshit.

1391
00:42:11,220 --> 00:42:13,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我痛恨这一点
I hated her for that.

1392
00:42:17,250 --> 00:42:19,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但她说的一切都是真的
But everything she said was true.

1393
00:42:21,090 --> 00:42:23,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她知道的
She knew...

1394
00:42:25,220 --> 00:42:27,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但没人肯相信她
and nobody believed her...

1395
00:42:29,050 --> 00:42:30,970
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}连我在内
not even me.

1396
00:42:32,930 --> 00:42:34,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们得把她弄出医院
Listen. We gotta get her out of there.

1397
00:42:34,890 --> 00:42:38,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}否决  T-1000精明狡猾
Negative. The T-1000's highest probability for success now...

1398
00:42:38,350 --> 00:42:41,400
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在可能已经变成莎拉·康纳  等你去自投罗网
will be to copy Sarah Connor and wait for you to make contact with her.

1399
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:43,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那她会怎样?
Great. What happens to her?

1400
00:42:43,650 --> 00:42:46,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}模仿的对象必须消灭
Typically, the subject being copied is terminated.

1401
00:42:46,610 --> 00:42:49,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}糟了  你怎么不早说?  我们得马上走
Shit! Why didn't you tell me? We gotta go right now!

1402
00:42:49,950 --> 00:42:52,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}否决  这不是我任务的重点
Negative. It's not a mission priority.

1403
00:42:52,120 --> 00:42:54,290
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但这是我的重点
Fuck you! She's a priority to me!

1404
00:42:56,120 --> 00:43:00,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}混蛋  你是怎么回事?  救命
Goddamn it! What's your problem? Help!

1405
00:43:00,210 --> 00:43:02,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这对我们的任务毫无用处
This does not help our mission.

1406
00:43:02,090 --> 00:43:04,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}救命  把这疯子赶走
Get this psycho off of me! Help!

1407
00:43:04,630 --> 00:43:07,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}救命  救命呀  他要绑架我  把这疯子赶走
I'm being kidnapped! Get this psycho off of me!

1408
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:08,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}放手
Let me go!

1409
00:43:13,350 --> 00:43:15,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你为何那样做?
Why did you do that?

1410
00:43:15,230 --> 00:43:17,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}因为你命令我"放手"
Because you told me to.

1411
00:43:19,980 --> 00:43:21,400
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}什么?
What?

1412
00:43:26,450 --> 00:43:28,410
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得照我的话去做  对吧?
You have to do what I say?

1413
00:43:28,490 --> 00:43:30,700
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那是我任务的一个最高原则
That's one of my mission parameters.

1414
00:43:31,990 --> 00:43:35,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}证明呀  用一只脚站立
Prove it. Stand on one foot.

1415
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:39,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好
Yes!

1416
00:43:41,250 --> 00:43:44,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真酷  只听我命令的终结者
Cool. My own Terminator. Wow.

1417
00:43:46,340 --> 00:43:47,590
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你没事吧  孩子?
You okay, kid?

1418
00:43:47,680 --> 00:43:49,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}滚开  别烦我
Take a hike, bozo.

1419
00:43:49,140 --> 00:43:51,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们别插手啦
Let's get outta here, man.

1420
00:43:51,810 --> 00:43:53,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}去你的  混球
Fuck you, you little dipshit!

1421
00:43:54,480 --> 00:43:55,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}混球?
Dipshit?

1422
00:43:58,060 --> 00:44:00,190
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把脚放下
Put your leg down.

1423
00:44:00,270 --> 00:44:05,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你敢叫<i>我</i>混球  - 只是想帮忙
- Did you call <i>moi</i> a dipshit? - Just trying to help this punk.

1424
00:44:05,200 --> 00:44:07,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}给这小子点颜色瞧瞧
Grab this guy.

1425
00:44:09,170 --> 00:44:10,370
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}放开我
Get him off of me!

1426
00:44:10,420 --> 00:44:12,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在谁是混球?
Now who's the dipshit...

1427
00:44:12,580 --> 00:44:14,370
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你个草包  - 放手
- you jock douche bag? - Get off!

1428
00:44:21,660 --> 00:44:22,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

1429
00:44:23,460 --> 00:44:25,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把枪放下  快
Put the gun down now!

1430
00:44:26,010 --> 00:44:29,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 离开这儿  - 兄弟  咱们快走
- Get outta here! - Come on. Let's split!

1431
00:44:36,190 --> 00:44:38,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天呀  你会把那人给杀了
You were gonna kill that guy!

1432
00:44:38,190 --> 00:44:40,360
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}当然  我是终结者
Of course. I'm a Terminator.

1433
00:44:42,570 --> 00:44:45,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}仔细听我说  好吗?
Listen to me very carefully, okay?

1434
00:44:45,280 --> 00:44:48,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你现在不再是终结者  好吗?
You're not a Terminator anymore, all right?

1435
00:44:48,700 --> 00:44:51,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}听懂了吗?
You got that?

1436
00:44:51,200 --> 00:44:53,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你就是不能随便到处杀人
You just can't go around killing people.

1437
00:44:53,540 --> 00:44:54,580
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}为什么?
Why?

1438
00:44:55,580 --> 00:44:57,710
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}什么意思?  反正就是不行
What do you mean, why? 'Cause you can't.

1439
00:44:57,760 --> 00:44:58,700
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}为什么?
Why?

1440
00:44:58,790 --> 00:45:01,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}因为你就是不能  好吗?  这件事你得信任我
Because you just can't, okay? Trust me on this.

1441
00:45:07,640 --> 00:45:11,100
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我要去救我妈
Look. I'm gonna go get my mom.

1442
00:45:11,180 --> 00:45:14,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我命令你要协助我
I order you to help me.

1443
00:47:41,590 --> 00:47:44,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}莎拉·康纳在这里吗?
You have a Sarah Connor here?

1444
00:47:44,090 --> 00:47:45,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你来迟了  是吗?
You're runnin' kind of late.

1445
00:47:45,840 --> 00:47:48,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他们已经来了一个多小时
They've been in there for an hour.

1446
00:47:48,310 --> 00:47:50,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}等一下  我替你通知
Hold on a second. I'll buzz you in.

1447
00:47:52,560 --> 00:47:56,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你的朋友来了
Oh, here come your friends now.

1448
00:48:58,170 --> 00:49:01,590
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 葛兰  要咖啡吗?  - 不  谢了
- Gwen, you want some coffee? - No, thanks.

1449
00:49:01,670 --> 00:49:04,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 来杯啤酒吧?  - 真爱说笑
- How 'bout a beer? - Yeah, right.

1450
00:49:28,540 --> 00:49:31,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 我中奖了  - 那可真棒
- Hey, I got a full house. - That's good, Louis.

1451
00:49:32,070 --> 00:49:34,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我走运了
Must be my lucky day.

1452
00:51:57,030 --> 00:51:59,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你说得没错
You're right about number 24.

1453
00:51:59,570 --> 00:52:02,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}给24号病房增加药剂量吧
Increase the medication to 250 milligrams.

1454
00:52:02,660 --> 00:52:04,970
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 还用同一种药吗?  - 对
- Same kind? - Mm-hmm.

1455
00:52:20,260 --> 00:52:22,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你
You!

1456
00:52:25,180 --> 00:52:27,100
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你弄断我的手臂了
You broke my arm.

1457
00:52:27,180 --> 00:52:29,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}人体内有215块骨头
There are 215 bones in the human body.

1458
00:52:30,060 --> 00:52:32,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不过是断一根而已  不准动
That's one. Now, don't move.

1459
00:52:33,770 --> 00:52:37,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"排水管洗洁剂  有毒"

1460
00:52:38,610 --> 00:52:40,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你想干什么?
What are you going to do?

1461
00:52:43,820 --> 00:52:45,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们停下来干什么?
Why do we stop now?

1462
00:52:47,200 --> 00:52:51,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得保证绝不杀人  好吗?
You gotta promise me you're not gonna kill anyone, right?

1463
00:52:51,080 --> 00:52:53,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 好  - 你发誓
- Right. - Swear?

1464
00:52:53,750 --> 00:52:55,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}什么?
What?

1465
00:52:55,340 --> 00:52:58,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}举手说  "我绝不杀人"
Just put up your hand and say, "I swear I won't kill anyone."

1466
00:52:59,550 --> 00:53:02,340
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我发誓我不杀任何人
I swear I will not kill anyone.

1467
00:53:02,730 --> 00:53:03,970
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好  咱们走
All right. Let's go.

1468
00:53:10,600 --> 00:53:12,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}会客时间是十点到四点
Visiting hours is 10:00 to 4:00...

1469
00:53:12,690 --> 00:53:14,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}周一到周五
Monday through Friday.

1470
00:53:18,650 --> 00:53:19,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你在干什么?
What are you doing?

1471
00:53:19,950 --> 00:53:22,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}王八蛋  你开枪打我
You son of a bitch! You shot me!

1472
00:53:24,370 --> 00:53:25,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}疯子
Crazy bastard!

1473
00:53:29,960 --> 00:53:32,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别再开枪了  别杀我
Don't shoot me again. Don't kill me.

1474
00:53:35,750 --> 00:53:37,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他死不了的
He'll live.

1475
00:53:52,230 --> 00:53:53,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}婊子养的
Son of a bitch!

1476
00:53:55,860 --> 00:53:57,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}大家别激动
Let's try to remain calm.

1477
00:53:57,230 --> 00:53:59,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}开门  否则他死定了
Open it, or he'll be dead before he hits the floor.

1478
00:53:59,240 --> 00:54:01,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你逃不了的  放开他
There's no way, Connor. Let him go.

1479
00:54:01,360 --> 00:54:03,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 把门打开  - 否则会怎样?
- Open the door. - It ain't gonna happen.

1480
00:54:03,990 --> 00:54:05,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别紧张
Take it easy, Sarah.

1481
00:54:05,910 --> 00:54:09,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}行不通的  我知道你不是杀手
It won't work. You're no killer. I don't believe you can do it.

1482
00:54:09,120 --> 00:54:12,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}反正你们都得死  索大夫  你知道我很认真
You're already dead. Everybody dies. You know I believe it.

1483
00:54:12,170 --> 00:54:14,210
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别跟我耍花招
So don't fuck with me!

1484
00:54:14,290 --> 00:54:15,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}开门
Open the door!

1485
00:54:15,350 --> 00:54:16,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快开门
Open the door!

1486
00:54:22,840 --> 00:54:24,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}退后
Back off!

1487
00:54:24,550 --> 00:54:25,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}退回去
Get back!

1488
00:54:25,730 --> 00:54:27,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我会让他死翘翘  我保证
I'll pump him full of this shit. I swear!

1489
00:54:27,750 --> 00:54:29,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}退后
Back!

1490
00:54:29,350 --> 00:54:31,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别动
Don't move!

1491
00:54:32,560 --> 00:54:33,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}丢掉木棍
Drop the shit!

1492
00:54:33,810 --> 00:54:35,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}照做
Do it!

1493
00:54:35,780 --> 00:54:37,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}让开
Get in the office.

1494
00:54:37,780 --> 00:54:39,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴在地上  脸朝下  你过来
On the floor, face down. Not you!

1495
00:54:39,900 --> 00:54:41,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把门打开
Open the door.

1496
00:54:44,430 --> 00:54:47,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴下  拉好门  面对墙壁
On the floor. Hold it open. Face the wall!

1497
00:55:03,890 --> 00:55:05,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抓住她
Get her!

1498
00:55:33,420 --> 00:55:36,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快打开
Hurry up! Open the door! The door's locked!

1499
00:55:37,510 --> 00:55:39,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快
Let's go! Open it!

1500
00:55:41,840 --> 00:55:43,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 锁被弄坏了  - 想办法打开
- She broke it off. - Open it!

1501
00:55:49,230 --> 00:55:51,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}往那边  快追
Let's go around! Come on! Move it!

1502
00:56:16,740 --> 00:56:17,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

1503
00:56:18,520 --> 00:56:19,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

1504
00:56:23,720 --> 00:56:24,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈  等等
Mom, wait!

1505
00:56:31,650 --> 00:56:32,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}休想逃走
Come back here!

1506
00:56:33,720 --> 00:56:34,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

1507
00:56:37,280 --> 00:56:38,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 救她呀  - 你别来
- Help her! - Wait here.

1508
00:56:38,990 --> 00:56:41,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 快帮忙  - 他会把我们都杀死的
- Hurry up! - He'll kill us all!

1509
00:56:42,870 --> 00:56:44,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}拉住她
Hold her.

1510
00:56:45,660 --> 00:56:46,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他会杀死我们的
He'll kill us all!

1511
00:57:09,020 --> 00:57:11,360
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈  你没事吧  妈
Mom, are you okay? Mom!

1512
00:57:15,820 --> 00:57:18,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}想活命就跟我走
Come with me if you want to live.

1513
00:57:18,320 --> 00:57:20,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不要紧  妈  他是来帮忙的
It's okay, Mom. He's here to help.

1514
00:57:45,560 --> 00:57:46,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快走
Go.

1515
00:58:18,970 --> 00:58:21,470
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它是什么东西?  这到底是怎么回事?
What the fuck is it? What the fuck is going on?

1516
00:58:36,270 --> 00:58:37,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴下
Get down.

1517
00:58:55,170 --> 00:58:56,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈
Mon.

1518
00:59:14,070 --> 00:59:15,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}下车
Out of the car!

1519
00:59:16,990 --> 00:59:18,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}立刻下车
Right now!

1520
00:59:42,640 --> 00:59:43,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走
Go!

1521
00:59:54,940 --> 00:59:56,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}子弹没了
I'm out.

1522
01:00:02,950 --> 01:00:04,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 快点  - 给
- Come on. - Here.

1523
01:00:07,370 --> 01:00:09,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}装弹
Reload.

1524
01:00:18,430 --> 01:00:20,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}最后一个
Last one!

1525
01:00:27,600 --> 01:00:28,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抓牢
Hang on.

1526
01:00:55,570 --> 01:00:56,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好了
Ready!

1527
01:01:02,720 --> 01:01:03,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

1528
01:01:10,910 --> 01:01:12,630
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你来开
You, drive.

1529
01:02:05,790 --> 01:02:08,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}甩掉他了  后面没人
He's not back there. There's nobody behind us.

1530
01:02:08,080 --> 01:02:10,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你没事吧?  - 没事
- Are you all right? - Yeah.

1531
01:02:12,480 --> 01:02:14,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你看的到路?
Can you see anything?

1532
01:02:14,780 --> 01:02:16,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我看的一清二楚
I see everything.

1533
01:02:16,730 --> 01:02:18,820
{\pos(287,10)\fscx50\an8}"路况能见度提升"

1534
01:02:19,050 --> 01:02:20,480
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}酷
Cool.

1535
01:02:24,270 --> 01:02:25,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}过来
Come here.

1536
01:02:31,940 --> 01:02:33,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我说过我没事
I said I was okay.

1537
01:02:34,490 --> 01:02:37,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  你来找我真是愚蠢
John, it was stupid of you to go there.

1538
01:02:38,530 --> 01:02:40,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你该有自知之明的
You have to be smarter than that.

1539
01:02:40,950 --> 01:02:42,580
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你差点连命都送掉
You were almost killed.

1540
01:02:43,680 --> 01:02:45,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你到底在想什么?
What were you thinking?

1541
01:02:46,370 --> 01:02:49,060
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你不该冒险  为我也不行
You cannot risk yourself, even for me.

1542
01:02:49,080 --> 01:02:52,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你的命太重要了
Do you understand? You're too important.

1543
01:02:52,340 --> 01:02:55,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你懂吗?
Do you understand?

1544
01:02:57,890 --> 01:02:59,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}可是...
But...

1545
01:03:00,890 --> 01:03:04,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我必须把你从那儿就出来  对不起
I had to get you out of that place. I'm sorry.

1546
01:03:05,640 --> 01:03:08,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不需要你协助  我自有办法
I didn't need your help. I can take care of myself.

1547
01:03:15,240 --> 01:03:16,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你的眼睛怎么了?
What's wrong with your eyes?

1548
01:03:18,820 --> 01:03:20,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没什么
Nothing.

1549
01:03:30,170 --> 01:03:32,630
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你又是什么来头?
So, what's your story?

1550
01:03:43,180 --> 01:03:44,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你没事?
You okay?

1551
01:03:44,350 --> 01:03:45,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}很好
Fine.

1552
01:03:47,610 --> 01:03:50,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这机车真不错
Say, that's a nice bike.

1553
01:04:13,420 --> 01:04:15,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}轻点行吗?  老粗
Watch it, lug nuts.

1554
01:04:22,640 --> 01:04:26,060
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你知道自己在干什么吗?
Listen, do you know what you're doing?

1555
01:04:26,150 --> 01:04:28,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我对人体构造非常了解
I have detailed files on human anatomy.

1556
01:04:29,860 --> 01:04:31,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我想也是
I bet.

1557
01:04:31,900 --> 01:04:34,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那使你更容易杀人  是吧?
Makes you a more efficient killer, right?

1558
01:04:34,990 --> 01:04:36,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没错
Correct.

1559
01:04:42,160 --> 01:04:44,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你被击中时会痛吗?
Does it hurt when you get shot?

1560
01:04:45,210 --> 01:04:48,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我感到受损  亦可称为"疼痛"
I sense injuries. The data could be called "pain."

1561
01:04:51,000 --> 01:04:52,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  帮我调整灯光
John, help me with the light.

1562
01:04:53,010 --> 01:04:55,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 会痊瘉吗?  - 会的
- Will these heal up? - Yes.

1563
01:04:55,380 --> 01:04:59,290
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那就好  你若不像人  对我们就没用
Good. If you can't pass for human, you're not much good to us.

1564
01:04:59,680 --> 01:05:02,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你能活多久?
How long do you live? I mean, last. Whatever.

1565
01:05:02,470 --> 01:05:05,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的电池可维持120年
A hundred and twenty years with my existing power cell.

1566
01:05:05,850 --> 01:05:08,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你能学习你电脑中还未输入过的事吗?
Can you learn stuff that you haven't been programmed with...

1567
01:05:08,860 --> 01:05:10,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}使你能够
so you can be...

1568
01:05:11,530 --> 01:05:14,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}更像人类?
you know, more human...

1569
01:05:14,320 --> 01:05:16,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这样你才不会像个傻蛋
and not such a dork all the time?

1570
01:05:18,430 --> 01:05:21,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的中央处理器是神经元处理器  也是学习型电脑
My CPU is a neural net processor, a learning computer.

1571
01:05:22,060 --> 01:05:26,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们外出时天网会将开关设置为"只可读取"
But Skynet presets the switch to read-only when we're sent out alone.

1572
01:05:26,590 --> 01:05:27,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}酷
Cool.

1573
01:05:59,580 --> 01:06:01,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在开始学习吧
Are we learning yet?

1574
01:06:13,930 --> 01:06:16,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们得尽量远离这座城市
We have to get as far away from the city as possible.

1575
01:06:20,600 --> 01:06:22,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}往南走
Just head south.

1576
01:06:30,990 --> 01:06:32,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}时速别超过65英里
Keep it under 65.

1577
01:06:32,650 --> 01:06:35,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 否则会被交警拦下  - 确认
- We don't want to be pulled over. - Affirmative.

1578
01:06:36,420 --> 01:06:37,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  不不
No, no, no.

1579
01:06:38,870 --> 01:06:41,370
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得学人类说话的方式
You gotta listen to the way people talk.

1580
01:06:41,450 --> 01:06:44,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你不能说"确认"那种鸟话
You don't say "affirmative" or some shit like that.

1581
01:06:45,040 --> 01:06:47,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你要说  <i>"没问题"</i>
You say, <i>"No problemo."</i>

1582
01:06:47,460 --> 01:06:51,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}如果有人找碴  你就说  "有种试试看"
If someone comes off to you with an attitude, you say, "Eat me."

1583
01:06:51,460 --> 01:06:55,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}如果要解决掉他们  就说<i>"拜拜了  宝贝"</i>
And if you want to shine them on, it's <i>"Hasta la vista, baby."</i>

1584
01:06:56,330 --> 01:06:58,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}拜拜了  宝贝
Hasta la vista, baby.

1585
01:06:58,970 --> 01:07:01,100
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  或者说  "去死吧  精虫"
Yeah, or "Later, dick-wad."

1586
01:07:01,180 --> 01:07:04,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}有人生气  你就说  "冷静点"
If someone gets upset, you say, "Chill out."

1587
01:07:04,310 --> 01:07:05,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}或者你也可以自由发挥
Or you can do combinations.

1588
01:07:06,480 --> 01:07:08,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}冷静点  精虫
Chill out, dick-wad.

1589
01:07:09,610 --> 01:07:11,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  看  你真的会了
That's great. See? You're getting it.

1590
01:07:11,920 --> 01:07:12,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没问题
No problemo.

1591
01:07:28,370 --> 01:07:30,290
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}要吃点薯条吗?
Want some of my fries?

1592
01:07:40,300 --> 01:07:42,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你需要帮忙吗?  - 不用
- Need any help? - No.

1593
01:07:43,480 --> 01:07:45,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 我杀死你了  - 不  你没有
- I got you! - No, you didn't!

1594
01:07:45,400 --> 01:07:47,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你死了  - 才没有呢
- I got you! - No, you didn't!

1595
01:07:52,300 --> 01:07:53,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}去你的  混球
I got you!

1596
01:07:54,280 --> 01:07:57,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们撑不过去  对吧
We're not gonna make it, are we?

1597
01:07:59,320 --> 01:08:00,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我是指人类
People, I mean.

1598
01:08:03,700 --> 01:08:05,780
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们天性便有自我毁灭倾向
It's in your nature to destroy yourselves.

1599
01:08:06,620 --> 01:08:09,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  真无聊  是吧?
Yeah. Major drag, huh?

1600
01:08:09,630 --> 01:08:12,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快住手  要不掐断你们脖子
Break it up before I wring both of your necks.

1601
01:08:14,670 --> 01:08:17,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我要知道"天网"系统的起源
I need to know how Skynet gets built.

1602
01:08:17,840 --> 01:08:19,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是谁研究出来的?
Who's responsible?

1603
01:08:19,180 --> 01:08:22,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}直接负责的人是莫斯·戴森
The man most directly responsible is Miles Bennett Dyson.

1604
01:08:22,810 --> 01:08:24,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}谁呀?
Who is that?

1605
01:08:24,600 --> 01:08:28,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}塞柏电脑公司特别企划室主任
He's the director of special projects at Cyberdyne Systems Corporation.

1606
01:08:31,310 --> 01:08:33,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}为何是他?
Why him?

1607
01:08:33,150 --> 01:08:36,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}数月内他会研制出新型微电脑
In a few months, he creates a revolutionary type of microprocessor.

1608
01:08:37,570 --> 01:08:39,210
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}然后呢?
Go on. Then what?

1609
01:08:40,030 --> 01:08:42,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}三年内塞柏会成为军方电脑来源
In three years Cyberdyne will become the largest supplier...

1610
01:08:43,030 --> 01:08:44,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}负责高阶研发
of military computer systems.

1611
01:08:45,500 --> 01:08:48,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}所有轰炸机都会装载塞柏的电脑系统
All Stealth bombers are upgraded with Cyberdyne computers...

1612
01:08:48,500 --> 01:08:49,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}成为无人操作机型
becoming fully unmanned.

1613
01:08:50,040 --> 01:08:53,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}然后它创造了完美的运作记录
Afterwards they fly with a perfect operational record.

1614
01:08:53,170 --> 01:08:55,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天网计划法案正式通过
The Skynet funding bill is passed.

1615
01:08:55,880 --> 01:08:59,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}1997年8月4日  电脑系统上线
The system goes on-line on August 4, 1997.

1616
01:08:59,260 --> 01:09:02,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它迅速掌握战略防卫系统
Human decisions are removed from strategic defense.

1617
01:09:02,510 --> 01:09:05,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天网电脑以极快速度吸取经验
Skynet begins to learn at a geometric rate.

1618
01:09:05,310 --> 01:09:10,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它产生自我意识  时间为8月29日上午2时14分
It becomes self-aware at 2:14 a.m. Eastern time, August 29.

1619
01:09:10,690 --> 01:09:13,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}人类惊慌失措  准备应变
In a panic, they try to pull the plug.

1620
01:09:14,400 --> 01:09:16,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 但天网却先发制人  - 是的
- Skynet fights back. - Yes.

1621
01:09:16,740 --> 01:09:19,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它向俄罗斯境内目标发射飞弹
It launches its missiles against the targets in Russia.

1622
01:09:19,570 --> 01:09:22,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}为何攻击俄国?  他们现在不是我们的朋友吗?
Why attack Russia? Aren't they our friends now?

1623
01:09:22,700 --> 01:09:27,210
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天网知道俄方反击便可消灭美国
Skynet knows the Russian counterattack will eliminate its enemies over here.

1624
01:09:27,310 --> 01:09:28,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天啦
Jesus.

1625
01:09:31,420 --> 01:09:33,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你对戴森了解多少?
How much do you know about Dyson?

1626
01:09:35,510 --> 01:09:37,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我有他的详细资料
I have detailed files.

1627
01:09:38,640 --> 01:09:40,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我要知道一切
I want to know everything.

1628
01:09:41,810 --> 01:09:45,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他的长相  住址  一切
What he looks like, where he lives, everything.

1629
01:10:13,970 --> 01:10:15,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}在车上等着
Wait in the car.

1630
01:10:54,140 --> 01:10:56,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你真性急  康纳
You're pretty jumpy, Connor.

1631
01:10:57,360 --> 01:10:59,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你也是
You too.

1632
01:11:16,740 --> 01:11:18,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰
Hey, big John.

1633
01:11:19,120 --> 01:11:20,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你好
What's up?

1634
01:11:20,350 --> 01:11:21,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他是谁?
Who is this guy?

1635
01:11:21,850 --> 01:11:23,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他没问题  他跟我来的
He's cool, Enrique. He's with me.

1636
01:11:23,920 --> 01:11:27,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他是  包伯叔
He's... Uncle Bob.

1637
01:11:27,170 --> 01:11:29,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}包伯叔  这是恩里克
Uncle Bob, this is Enrique.

1638
01:11:29,460 --> 01:11:31,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}包伯叔?
Uncle Bob, huh?

1639
01:11:32,300 --> 01:11:34,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好吧  自己人
Okay.

1640
01:11:40,550 --> 01:11:41,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}要喝吗?
Drink?

1641
01:11:46,940 --> 01:11:48,360
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}包伯叔?
"Uncle Bob"?

1642
01:11:50,360 --> 01:11:53,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们很有名  都上了电视
You're pretty famous, all over the goddamn TV.

1643
01:11:53,240 --> 01:11:55,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}条子就像疯狗似的
Pictures of you, John, your big friend here.

1644
01:11:55,990 --> 01:11:57,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}想揪你们出来呢
Cops are going nuts looking for you.

1645
01:12:01,870 --> 01:12:05,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我需要衣物  食物  和一辆卡车
I just came for my stuff. I need clothes, food and a truck.

1646
01:12:05,850 --> 01:12:08,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}要不要我连假牙都一起给你?
How about the fillings in my teeth?

1647
01:12:08,250 --> 01:12:10,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在就要
Now, Enrique.

1648
01:12:11,550 --> 01:12:14,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们也去  去拿武器
You two, you're on weapons detail.

1649
01:12:14,420 --> 01:12:15,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走吧
Come on, let's go.

1650
01:12:36,120 --> 01:12:38,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我妈有个特点
One thing about my mom...

1651
01:12:40,330 --> 01:12:42,290
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她总是未雨绸缪
she always plans ahead.

1652
01:12:52,950 --> 01:12:54,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好极了
Excellent.

1653
01:13:04,810 --> 01:13:08,480
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这是最好的车  但缺起动马达
This is my best truck, but the starter motor's gone.

1654
01:13:08,570 --> 01:13:10,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你有时间等它装好吗?
You got time to change it out?

1655
01:13:10,570 --> 01:13:13,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 可以  我要等午夜之后再越过边境  - 那好
- Yeah. I'm gonna wait till dark to cross the border. - Okay.

1656
01:13:16,020 --> 01:13:18,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我在这种地方长大
See, I grew up in places like this...

1657
01:13:18,660 --> 01:13:21,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我还以为人就是这样过活
so I just thought that's how people lived...

1658
01:13:21,040 --> 01:13:23,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}驾驶着直升机
riding around in helicopters...

1659
01:13:23,330 --> 01:13:25,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}学习如何炸东西
learning how to blow shit up.

1660
01:13:30,300 --> 01:13:31,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}很适合你
That's definitely you.

1661
01:13:42,680 --> 01:13:46,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}与我妈来往的男人都是怪人
Most of the guys my mom hung around with were geeks...

1662
01:13:46,310 --> 01:13:49,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但有个家伙倒很酷
but there was this one guy, he was kinda cool.

1663
01:13:49,900 --> 01:13:51,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他教我玩这些
He taught me engines.

1664
01:13:51,900 --> 01:13:54,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}撑住这儿
Hold here.

1665
01:13:54,150 --> 01:13:56,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}后来他们还是分手了
Mom screwed it up, of course.

1666
01:13:56,660 --> 01:13:59,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她总是在谈审判日等等之类的话题
She'd always tell 'em about Judgment Day...

1667
01:13:59,160 --> 01:14:01,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}也许直到今天
and me being this world leader.

1668
01:14:02,040 --> 01:14:04,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她脑里仍只想这一件事
That'd be all she wrote.

1669
01:14:05,330 --> 01:14:06,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}请把钳子给我
Torque wrench, please.

1670
01:14:08,620 --> 01:14:09,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}拿去
Here.

1671
01:14:10,000 --> 01:14:13,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真希望能见到我生父
I wish I could've met my real dad.

1672
01:14:13,300 --> 01:14:14,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你会的
You will.

1673
01:14:15,130 --> 01:14:17,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对
Yeah, I guess.

1674
01:14:17,390 --> 01:14:20,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那时我已经45岁了
When I'm, like, 45, I think.

1675
01:14:21,310 --> 01:14:25,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我会派他回到1984年
They sent him back through time to 1984.

1676
01:14:25,100 --> 01:14:26,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天啦
Man.

1677
01:14:28,070 --> 01:14:30,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他现在还没出生呢
He hasn't even been born yet.

1678
01:14:32,320 --> 01:14:34,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真不可思议
It messes with your head.

1679
01:14:36,990 --> 01:14:39,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 把螺丝帽给我  - 给
- The other bolt. - Oh. Here.

1680
01:14:46,250 --> 01:14:49,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她只和他共处了一个晚上
Mom and him were only together for one night.

1681
01:14:49,880 --> 01:14:52,340
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我想她仍爱着他
She still loves him, I guess.

1682
01:14:52,420 --> 01:14:55,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}有时我看见她在哭
I see her crying sometimes.

1683
01:14:55,390 --> 01:14:59,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}当然啦  她完全否认  她说那是有异物吹进眼里
She denies it totally, of course, like she got something stuck in her eye.

1684
01:15:04,350 --> 01:15:05,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们为何哭泣?
Why do you cry?

1685
01:15:06,980 --> 01:15:08,480
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你是说人类?  - 对
- You mean people? - Yeah.

1686
01:15:08,570 --> 01:15:09,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不知道
I don't know.

1687
01:15:10,030 --> 01:15:12,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他们就是会哭
We just cry...

1688
01:15:12,190 --> 01:15:14,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}尤其是"伤心"的时候
you know, when it hurts.

1689
01:15:20,830 --> 01:15:22,580
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是"伤"造成的?
Pain causes it?

1690
01:15:23,660 --> 01:15:25,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  那不一样
No. It's different.

1691
01:15:25,880 --> 01:15:29,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}虽然你没事  但伤心时就会哭
It's when there's nothing wrong with you, but you hurt anyway.

1692
01:15:29,250 --> 01:15:30,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 懂吗?  - 不懂
- You get it? - No.

1693
01:15:32,090 --> 01:15:33,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那才像话
All right, my man!

1694
01:15:34,220 --> 01:15:35,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没问题
No problemo.

1695
01:15:35,640 --> 01:15:37,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}击掌庆祝
Give me five.

1696
01:15:39,310 --> 01:15:41,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}像这样撑开手掌  来
Just put out your hand like this, come on.

1697
01:15:42,770 --> 01:15:47,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}很好  拍打我的手  该你了  你来击掌
All right! Now hit me. Give me five. Do the same thing.

1698
01:15:47,200 --> 01:15:48,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}很好
All right!

1699
01:15:51,820 --> 01:15:54,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好  很好  来个高的
Okay, that's good. Up high.

1700
01:15:55,220 --> 01:15:56,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}低的
Five low.

1701
01:15:57,080 --> 01:15:58,360
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你慢了
Too slow.

1702
01:16:01,290 --> 01:16:03,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我是在开玩笑  再来一次
I'm just kidding. One more time.

1703
01:16:03,620 --> 01:16:05,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}很好  接着来
Good. Now try it.

1704
01:16:05,920 --> 01:16:07,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}来  打我一掌
Now do me. Give me five.

1705
01:16:09,340 --> 01:16:13,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>看到约翰和机器人在一起  突然真相大白了</i>
<i>Watching John with the machine, it was suddenly so clear.</i>

1706
01:16:13,970 --> 01:16:16,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>终结者绝不罢休</i>
<i>The Terminator would never stop.</i>

1707
01:16:16,970 --> 01:16:20,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>绝不离开他  它不会伤害他</i>
<i>It would never leave him, never hurt him...</i>

1708
01:16:21,020 --> 01:16:24,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>不会向他叫骂  不会酒醉打他</i>
<i>never shout at him or get drunk and hit him...</i>

1709
01:16:24,520 --> 01:16:27,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>或是藉口太忙没空陪他</i>
<i>or be too busy to spend time with him.</i>

1710
01:16:27,980 --> 01:16:30,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>它永远会在他身边</i>
<i>It would always be there...</i>

1711
01:16:30,150 --> 01:16:32,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>它会拼命保卫他</i>
<i>and it would die to protect him.</i>

1712
01:16:34,240 --> 01:16:37,580
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这些年来  我遇到过许多男人</i>
<i>Of all the would-be fathers who came and went over the years...</i>

1713
01:16:37,660 --> 01:16:39,700
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这东西  这机器</i>
<i>this thing, this machine...</i>

1714
01:16:39,790 --> 01:16:42,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>却是唯一有资格当他父亲的人</i>
<i>was the only one who measured up.</i>

1715
01:16:42,920 --> 01:16:44,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>在这疯狂世界里</i>
<i>In an insane world...</i>

1716
01:16:44,830 --> 01:16:46,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这是最佳选择</i>
<i>it was the sanest choice.</i>

1717
01:18:24,560 --> 01:18:26,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们来玩玩这个
Hey, let's try this one.

1718
01:18:32,150 --> 01:18:34,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}来吧
There we go.

1719
01:19:58,340 --> 01:20:00,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"不是命运"

1720
01:20:20,440 --> 01:20:22,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她叫你们按原计划向南走
She said go south with him like you planned.

1721
01:20:23,020 --> 01:20:25,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 她明天会赶上你们  - 妈
- She'll meet you tomorrow. - Mom!

1722
01:20:27,020 --> 01:20:28,190
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈等等
Mom, wait!

1723
01:20:43,460 --> 01:20:44,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"不是命运"
"No fate."

1724
01:20:46,130 --> 01:20:48,590
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}命运是要自己开创的
No fate but what we make.

1725
01:20:50,720 --> 01:20:52,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的父亲告诉她的
My father told her this.

1726
01:20:55,260 --> 01:20:59,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是未来的我让我父亲告诉她的
I made him memorize it in the future as a message to her.

1727
01:21:01,230 --> 01:21:03,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}算了
Never mind.

1728
01:21:03,230 --> 01:21:06,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}整件事就是这样
Okay, the whole thing goes...

1729
01:21:06,650 --> 01:21:09,360
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}一切尚未成为定局
The future's not set.

1730
01:21:09,440 --> 01:21:12,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}未来仍可以自己去开创
There's no fate but what we make for ourselves.

1731
01:21:13,030 --> 01:21:16,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她想改变未来?
She intends to change the future.

1732
01:21:16,120 --> 01:21:17,580
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  我猜也是
Yeah, I guess.

1733
01:21:19,120 --> 01:21:20,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}糟了
Oh, shit!

1734
01:21:21,040 --> 01:21:22,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 戴森  - 对
- Dyson. - Yeah.

1735
01:21:23,040 --> 01:21:26,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}一定是的  莫斯·戴森
Gotta be. Miles Dyson.

1736
01:21:26,630 --> 01:21:28,630
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}她想要杀了戴森
She's gonna blow him away.

1737
01:21:28,710 --> 01:21:30,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}来  咱们走
Come on! Let's go!

1738
01:21:31,190 --> 01:21:32,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快啊
Come on!

1739
01:21:43,190 --> 01:21:45,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}事实上  这样做非常危险
This is tactically dangerous.

1740
01:21:45,320 --> 01:21:46,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}开快点
Drive faster.

1741
01:21:46,530 --> 01:21:49,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}T-1000跟我一样了解情况
The T-1000 has the same files that I do.

1742
01:21:49,110 --> 01:21:52,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它知道我知道的一切  它还能预测敌人的行动
It knows what I know. It might anticipate this move.

1743
01:21:52,620 --> 01:21:54,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不管  咱们得阻止她
I don't care. We gotta stop her.

1744
01:21:55,200 --> 01:21:57,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}杀死戴森的确有可能阻止战争
Killing Dyson might prevent the war.

1745
01:21:57,380 --> 01:22:01,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不管  你还没学通吗?
I don't care! Haven't you learned anything yet?

1746
01:22:01,220 --> 01:22:03,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你还不明白为何不能乱杀人吗?
Haven't you figured out why you can't kill people?

1747
01:22:10,320 --> 01:22:12,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}丹尼  叫你去睡觉  我说真的
Danny, I told you to go to bed, I'm not kidding.

1748
01:22:13,050 --> 01:22:15,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}再玩一会儿就好  妈
Just a couple of minutes, Mom!

1749
01:22:24,320 --> 01:22:26,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}丹尼  睡觉时间到了
Danny, your time is up!

1750
01:22:26,740 --> 01:22:29,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快刷牙上床
Come brush your teeth and get to bed.

1751
01:22:58,320 --> 01:22:59,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}丹尼
Danny.

1752
01:23:11,400 --> 01:23:12,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}爸
Daddy!

1753
01:23:12,870 --> 01:23:15,370
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这不是游戏  快逃
Danny, go! Go!

1754
01:23:17,120 --> 01:23:18,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}莫斯
Miles.

1755
01:23:23,340 --> 01:23:25,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 特瑞莎  跑  - 我的天啊
- Tarissa, run! - Oh, my God!

1756
01:23:32,850 --> 01:23:34,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快带丹尼走  快逃
Just take Danny and run!

1757
01:23:34,980 --> 01:23:36,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快逃
Run!

1758
01:23:36,310 --> 01:23:38,060
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的天呀
Oh, Jesus! Miles!

1759
01:23:56,960 --> 01:23:57,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}爹地
Daddy!

1760
01:23:58,120 --> 01:23:59,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}丹尼
Danny.

1761
01:23:59,670 --> 01:24:01,130
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}谁都不许动
Nobody fucking move!

1762
01:24:01,960 --> 01:24:03,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别伤害我爸
Don't hurt my daddy!

1763
01:24:03,300 --> 01:24:04,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴到地上
On the floor, bitch.

1764
01:24:04,930 --> 01:24:06,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴下
Get down now!

1765
01:24:07,970 --> 01:24:09,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}让开
Get out of the way!

1766
01:24:09,140 --> 01:24:10,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别伤害他
Don't hurt him!

1767
01:24:12,100 --> 01:24:14,100
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}让开  否则我开枪
Get on the floor now!

1768
01:24:17,150 --> 01:24:18,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}饶了孩子吧
Just let the boy go.

1769
01:24:18,940 --> 01:24:20,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你闭嘴
Shut up. Shut up.

1770
01:24:20,610 --> 01:24:21,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}闭嘴
Shut up!

1771
01:24:21,980 --> 01:24:24,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}都是你的错  混蛋
It's all your fault, motherfucker.

1772
01:24:24,650 --> 01:24:26,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 都是你的错  - 什么?
- It's all your fault! - What?

1773
01:24:26,990 --> 01:24:29,120
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不会让你得逞的
I'm not gonna let you do it.

1774
01:25:21,130 --> 01:25:23,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}糟了  太迟了
Shit! We're too late!

1775
01:25:27,720 --> 01:25:28,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}看看他们
Check them.

1776
01:25:32,520 --> 01:25:34,520
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}看着我  妈
Look at me, Mom.

1777
01:25:34,600 --> 01:25:36,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你受伤了?
Are you hurt?

1778
01:25:37,280 --> 01:25:38,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}看着我
Look at me.

1779
01:25:40,440 --> 01:25:42,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我几乎
I almost...

1780
01:25:43,130 --> 01:25:44,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我下不了手
I almost...

1781
01:25:54,170 --> 01:25:56,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}放心吧
It'll be okay.

1782
01:25:56,580 --> 01:25:58,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}一定还有办法的  真的
We'll figure something out. Okay?

1783
01:26:00,130 --> 01:26:01,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}相信我吧
I promise.

1784
01:26:05,050 --> 01:26:08,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你是来阻止我的?
You came here to stop me.

1785
01:26:08,890 --> 01:26:10,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对
Yeah, I did.

1786
01:26:13,730 --> 01:26:15,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我爱你  约翰
I love you, John.

1787
01:26:17,400 --> 01:26:18,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我一直爱着你
I always have.

1788
01:26:20,900 --> 01:26:22,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我知道
I know.

1789
01:26:29,330 --> 01:26:31,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}子弹贯穿
Deep penetration.

1790
01:26:33,120 --> 01:26:35,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没有击碎骨头
No shattered bone.

1791
01:26:35,120 --> 01:26:38,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把伤口压着就能止住血了
Hold here. The pressure should stop the bleeding.

1792
01:26:48,850 --> 01:26:50,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们是谁?
Who are you people?

1793
01:26:51,230 --> 01:26:52,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}告诉他
Show him.

1794
01:26:55,310 --> 01:26:59,480
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}丹尼  你跟我走好吗?  带我看看你房间
Danny, I want you to come with me right now. Show me your room.

1795
01:27:39,980 --> 01:27:41,190
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的天呀
Oh, my God.

1796
01:27:41,280 --> 01:27:43,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}仔细听我说
Now listen to me very carefully.

1797
01:27:49,830 --> 01:27:53,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>戴森听着终结者的解说</i>
<i>Dyson listened while the Terminator laid it all down.</i>

1798
01:27:54,040 --> 01:27:57,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>天网  审判日</i>
<i>Skynet. Judgment Day.</i>

1799
01:27:58,000 --> 01:28:00,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>未来的历史</i>
<i>The history of things to come.</i>

1800
01:28:01,720 --> 01:28:04,470
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>知道自己的研发成果最终将会</i>
<i>It's not every day that you find out you're responsible...</i>

1801
01:28:04,550 --> 01:28:07,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>害死三十亿人</i>
<i>for three billion deaths.</i>

1802
01:28:07,470 --> 01:28:09,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>他的反应还算好</i>
<i>He took it pretty well.</i>

1803
01:28:11,390 --> 01:28:13,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我想我要呕吐了
I feel like I'm gonna throw up.

1804
01:28:19,860 --> 01:28:21,990
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你是为了
You're judging me...

1805
01:28:22,070 --> 01:28:24,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我还未做的事惩罚我?
on things I haven't even done yet.

1806
01:28:28,740 --> 01:28:30,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我怎会知道?
How were we supposed to know?

1807
01:28:33,330 --> 01:28:35,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对
Yeah.

1808
01:28:35,380 --> 01:28:37,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没错
Right.

1809
01:28:37,840 --> 01:28:39,960
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你怎会知道?
How were you supposed to know?

1810
01:28:41,010 --> 01:28:44,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}氢弹就是你这种人发明的
Fucking men like you built the hydrogen bomb.

1811
01:28:44,800 --> 01:28:47,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}也是你这种人
Men like you...

1812
01:28:47,470 --> 01:28:48,890
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}引爆它的
thought it up.

1813
01:28:52,770 --> 01:28:54,730
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你以为你很有创造力
You think you're so creative.

1814
01:28:56,150 --> 01:28:59,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你根本就不知道创造的意义
You don't know what it's like to really create something...

1815
01:28:59,320 --> 01:29:01,450
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}创造生命
to create a life...

1816
01:29:01,530 --> 01:29:03,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是感觉它在体内成长
to feel it growing inside you.

1817
01:29:03,160 --> 01:29:06,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你只会创造死亡和毁灭
All you know how to create is death and destruction.

1818
01:29:06,160 --> 01:29:07,830
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈
Mom!

1819
01:29:07,910 --> 01:29:11,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你得说些有建设性的话  好吗?
We need to be a little more constructive here. Okay?

1820
01:29:11,750 --> 01:29:14,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们仍要阻止战争的  对吧?
We still have to stop this from happening, don't we?

1821
01:29:14,320 --> 01:29:16,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但我以为
But I thought...

1822
01:29:16,840 --> 01:29:20,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们是要通过改变现在的事  从而改变未来的事吗?
Aren't we changing things right now, changing the way it goes?

1823
01:29:20,920 --> 01:29:22,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没错
That's right.

1824
01:29:22,520 --> 01:29:25,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}本来就快做出超级新电脑
There's no way I'm going to finish the new processor. Not now.

1825
01:29:25,800 --> 01:29:29,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在一切免谈  我不干了  我明天就辞职
Forget it. I'm out of it. I'll quit Cyberdyne tomorrow.

1826
01:29:29,350 --> 01:29:31,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那还不够好
That's not good enough.

1827
01:29:31,310 --> 01:29:33,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不能让别人继续完成你的工作
No one must follow your work.

1828
01:29:33,340 --> 01:29:34,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好吧
Right.

1829
01:29:35,270 --> 01:29:39,610
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}那得摧毁实验室的一切装备
All right, then we have to destroy all the stuff at the lab...

1830
01:29:39,690 --> 01:29:41,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}档案  磁碟机
the files, the disk drives...

1831
01:29:41,360 --> 01:29:43,990
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}所有的一切
everything here.

1832
01:29:44,070 --> 01:29:46,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}一切资料
Everything.

1833
01:29:46,240 --> 01:29:48,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不在乎
I don't care.

1834
01:29:49,450 --> 01:29:50,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}晶片
The chip.

1835
01:29:50,540 --> 01:29:52,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你们知道晶片吗?  - 什么晶片?
- Do you know about the chip? - What chip?

1836
01:29:52,710 --> 01:29:55,480
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他们把它锁在金库里  是跟你一样的机器人身上的
It's at Cyberdyne. It's from the other one like you.

1837
01:29:55,560 --> 01:29:57,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}第一代终结者的记忆体
The CPU from the first Terminator.

1838
01:29:58,010 --> 01:30:00,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}混蛋  我就知道
Son of a bitch! I knew it!

1839
01:30:00,470 --> 01:30:03,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他们不准我们问晶片是哪儿来的
They told us not to ask where they got it.

1840
01:30:03,260 --> 01:30:05,600
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}真聪明的混蛋
Those lying motherfuckers.

1841
01:30:05,680 --> 01:30:07,470
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它很可怕  但非常先进
It's scary stuff. Radically advanced.

1842
01:30:07,560 --> 01:30:08,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它被砸烂了
It was smashed.

1843
01:30:08,770 --> 01:30:12,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}无法运作  但它给了我许多不可思议的灵感
It didn't work, but it gave us ideas, took us in new directions.

1844
01:30:12,480 --> 01:30:14,480
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}前所未有
Things we would've never...

1845
01:30:16,650 --> 01:30:18,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的工作全是以它为基础
All my work was based on it.

1846
01:30:18,820 --> 01:30:20,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}必须摧毁它
It must be destroyed.

1847
01:30:22,910 --> 01:30:25,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你能带我们通过警卫吗?
Can you get us in? Past security?

1848
01:30:25,990 --> 01:30:28,080
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我想可以  什么时候去?
I think so, yeah. When?

1849
01:30:33,000 --> 01:30:34,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在?
Now?

1850
01:30:37,920 --> 01:30:40,970
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>未来对我而言已成为</i>
<i>The future, always so clear to me...</i>

1851
01:30:41,050 --> 01:30:44,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>深夜中的一条看不见的公路</i>
<i>had become like a black highway at night.</i>

1852
01:30:44,140 --> 01:30:46,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>而人类在未加分隔的领域中</i>
<i>We were in uncharted territory now...</i>

1853
01:30:46,930 --> 01:30:49,850
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>在前进的旅程上不断创造历史</i>
<i>making up history as we went along.</i>

1854
01:30:50,940 --> 01:30:52,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"塞柏电脑公司"

1855
01:31:28,180 --> 01:31:30,100
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你是卡尔吧?
Carl, right?

1856
01:31:31,440 --> 01:31:34,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我一些外地朋友
Friends from out of town. I just thought I'd...

1857
01:31:34,940 --> 01:31:37,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我只想带他们上楼四处瞧瞧
take 'em upstairs and show 'em around.

1858
01:31:37,090 --> 01:31:40,320
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}戴森先生  你也知道规定  带客人进实验室时
Mr. Dyson, you know the rules concerning visitors in the lab.

1859
01:31:40,400 --> 01:31:42,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我需要书面许可
I need written authorization...

1860
01:31:43,620 --> 01:31:45,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我坚持
I insist.

1861
01:31:45,700 --> 01:31:47,450
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你休想妄动
Don't even think about it.

1862
01:31:58,420 --> 01:31:59,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}行了
It's okay.

1863
01:32:01,300 --> 01:32:04,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}开金库要两把钥匙  而且得同时插入旋转
It takes two keys, turned simultaneously, to open the vault.

1864
01:32:04,510 --> 01:32:07,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}另一支在警卫室里
The other one is in a locker at the security station.

1865
01:32:08,770 --> 01:32:10,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}吉文
Gibbons?

1866
01:32:13,270 --> 01:32:15,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}吉文  老兄
Gibbons! Come on, man!

1867
01:32:15,190 --> 01:32:18,280
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你不能擅离岗位的
You can't leave the desk like that!

1868
01:32:20,350 --> 01:32:21,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}吉文
Gibbons!

1869
01:32:23,120 --> 01:32:24,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}糟糕
Oh, shit.

1870
01:32:42,180 --> 01:32:44,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的卡片应该可以开启它
My card should access this.

1871
01:32:47,810 --> 01:32:48,710
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}什么?
What?

1872
01:32:48,850 --> 01:32:51,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 怎么回事?  - 可恶
- What is it? - Damn it.

1873
01:32:51,350 --> 01:32:53,310
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}警报器已经启动
The silent alarm's been tripped.

1874
01:32:59,490 --> 01:33:02,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它使所有启动密码都失效了
It's neutralized all the codes in the entire building.

1875
01:33:02,320 --> 01:33:04,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}现在到处都不通了
Nothing will open anywhere now.

1876
01:33:05,330 --> 01:33:07,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们得放弃此事
We have to abort.

1877
01:33:07,330 --> 01:33:08,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

1878
01:33:10,370 --> 01:33:13,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们干到底
We go all the way. Okay?

1879
01:33:15,920 --> 01:33:19,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们在实验室开始行动  我能打开这个
You guys get started on the lab. I can open this.

1880
01:33:19,800 --> 01:33:22,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 是大闹商场的家伙  - 是那家伙
- I think it's that guy from the mall. - It is.

1881
01:33:22,340 --> 01:33:24,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  是他和那女人
Yeah. It's him and the woman.

1882
01:33:25,850 --> 01:33:29,020
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}立即总动员到这里来
Just send everything you got in the area right now.

1883
01:33:31,230 --> 01:33:34,690
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我的私人密码可能还能通
I have a personal entry code for the lab. It may still work.

1884
01:33:39,200 --> 01:33:40,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}没有用
It's no good.

1885
01:33:40,320 --> 01:33:41,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}试试我的法子
Let me try mine.

1886
01:33:46,830 --> 01:33:48,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  小心
John, fire in the hole!

1887
01:34:00,970 --> 01:34:05,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}且慢  现在不能进去  火焰启动了"海龙消防系统"
Wait! You can't go in there. The fire set off the Halon system.

1888
01:34:12,940 --> 01:34:15,400
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}等几分钟  要让毒气消散
You have to wait until the gas clears.

1889
01:34:17,900 --> 01:34:19,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}戴防毒面具
Put this on.

1890
01:34:33,170 --> 01:34:35,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}来吧  开工了
All right, let's get to work.

1891
01:34:56,860 --> 01:35:00,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>所有管区及可以应召的各组注意</i>
<i>All units in the vicinity and all units able to respond...</i>

1892
01:35:00,240 --> 01:35:05,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>在克拉马街2144号塞柏大厦里</i>
<i>a 211 in progress, 2144 Kramer Street, the Cyberdyne building.</i>

1893
01:35:05,120 --> 01:35:06,790
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>发生犯罪事件</i>
