1896
01:35:13,420 --> 01:35:15,300
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>嫌犯二为白种男性</i>
<i>Suspect two: White male...</i>

1897
01:35:15,760 --> 01:35:20,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>因1984年在警局杀害警员而遭通缉</i>
<i>fitting description of the individual wanted for the murder of police officers in 1984.</i>

1898
01:35:20,340 --> 01:35:22,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>疑犯携带武器  极度危险</i>
<i>Suspects are armed and considered extreme...</i>

1899
01:36:14,900 --> 01:36:15,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好了
All right.

1900
01:36:16,100 --> 01:36:18,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}7-2-5-6
7-2-5-6.

1901
01:36:25,600 --> 01:36:26,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}赚到了
Easy money.

1902
01:36:36,020 --> 01:36:38,440
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}糟糕  不好了
Oh, shit. Not good.

1903
01:36:43,530 --> 01:36:45,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}进展如何?
How we doing?

1904
01:36:45,240 --> 01:36:46,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}已经定时
Primer cord is set.

1905
01:36:46,990 --> 01:36:49,460
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}再来一桶  再等两分钟
One more barrel, two more minutes.

1906
01:36:53,330 --> 01:36:56,250
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 我们如何引爆?  - 遥控引爆
- How do we set them off? - Remote control.

1907
01:36:56,480 --> 01:36:58,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}轻而易举
Piece of cake.

1908
01:36:58,800 --> 01:37:00,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 有人来了  - 是警察?
- We got company. - Police?

1909
01:37:00,600 --> 01:37:03,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 有多少人?  - 大概倾巢而出
- How many? - All of 'em, I think.

1910
01:37:03,850 --> 01:37:05,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你们走  我来解决这儿
Go. I'll finish here.

1911
01:37:07,220 --> 01:37:08,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快点
Come on.

1912
01:37:09,700 --> 01:37:11,500
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我来对付警察
I'll take care of the police.

1913
01:37:11,700 --> 01:37:13,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}等一下  你发过誓
Wait! You swore!

1914
01:37:15,980 --> 01:37:17,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}相信我
Trust me.

1915
01:37:30,710 --> 01:37:32,330
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>窗台上的人</i>
<i>You at the window!</i>

1916
01:37:32,420 --> 01:37:35,880
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>丢下武器  把双手放在头上</i>
<i>Drop your weapon and place your hands on top of your head!</i>

1917
01:37:37,210 --> 01:37:39,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}老天
Holy shit!

1918
01:37:39,130 --> 01:37:40,680
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是机关枪
That's a mini-gun!

1919
01:38:02,910 --> 01:38:05,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 快走  - 天啦
- Come on! - Oh, shit!

1920
01:38:05,330 --> 01:38:06,870
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快走
Go! Go! Go!

1921
01:38:46,190 --> 01:38:50,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"死伤人数: 零"

1922
01:38:54,460 --> 01:38:55,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}开火
Fire!

1923
01:39:13,270 --> 01:39:14,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}同时向左转
Same time, to the left.

1924
01:39:14,980 --> 01:39:17,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}一  二  三  开始
One, two, three, go.

1925
01:39:29,460 --> 01:39:32,290
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好了  我告诉你怎么开
All right. In order to get that out...

1926
01:39:39,090 --> 01:39:41,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们抓住天网的命脉了
We got Skynet by the balls now.

1927
01:39:41,930 --> 01:39:43,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快走吧
Come on, let's book.

1928
01:39:44,560 --> 01:39:46,470
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}停火
Hold your fire!

1929
01:40:11,670 --> 01:40:14,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 准备好了吗?  - 好了
- Ready to rock? - Ready.

1930
01:40:16,920 --> 01:40:18,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}该走了
Time to go.

1931
01:40:18,300 --> 01:40:19,760
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}马上
Now.

1932
01:40:19,840 --> 01:40:23,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 拿着  他们会用催泪瓦斯  - 快走
- Take this. They'll use gas. - Come on.

1933
01:40:23,470 --> 01:40:26,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快去开门  莫斯  把引爆器给我
Get started on the door. Miles, hand me the detonator.

1934
