{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴下
Get down!

1938
01:42:01,500 --> 01:42:02,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}给
Here.

1939
01:42:28,390 --> 01:42:31,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不知还能抓住这玩意儿多久
I don't know how much longer I can hold this.

1940
