{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是炸弹
Fall back!

1941
01:42:37,570 --> 01:42:39,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}大家出去
Everybody out!

1942
01:42:39,240 --> 01:42:41,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}炸弹  快跑
Fall back now! Go! Go! Go!

1943
01:43:16,570 --> 01:43:18,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>这里已经演变成战场</i>
<i>We got a war zone here!</i>

1944
01:43:45,230 --> 01:43:46,210
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"状况预测"

1945
01:43:50,440 --> 01:43:52,150
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}眼睛闭上
Shut your eyes.

1946
01:43:58,740 --> 01:44:01,820
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}待在这儿  我马上回来
Stay here. I'll be back.

1947
01:44:09,750 --> 01:44:12,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴在地上  面朝下
Get down on the floor! Face down!

1948
