{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴在地上
On the floor now!

1949
01:44:18,720 --> 01:44:20,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}行啦  干掉他
Okay, drop him!

1950
01:45:40,100 --> 01:45:41,510
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你拿着
Here, hold this.

1951
01:46:14,920 --> 01:46:15,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走
Go!

1952
01:46:54,880 --> 01:46:55,800
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}该死
Shit!

1953
01:47:09,400 --> 01:47:11,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}出去
Get out.

1954
01:47:30,130 --> 01:47:31,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}听着
Listen.

1955
01:47:31,500 --> 01:47:34,220
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不管怎样你都要躲好
No matter what happens, stay under these vests.

1956
01:47:34,300 --> 01:47:35,550
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 懂吗?  - 懂
- You got it? - Yeah.

1957
01:47:35,630 --> 01:47:37,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}好的
All right.

1958
01:47:51,650 --> 01:47:52,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}直升机来了
Chopper's coming in!

1959
01:47:52,990 --> 01:47:54,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}是它
It's him.

1960
01:48:51,880 --> 01:48:52,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}可恶
Shit!

1961
01:48:55,540 --> 01:48:57,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  趴好
John. Stay down!

1962
01:49:23,220 --> 01:49:24,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈
Mom.

1963
01:50:12,170 --> 01:50:14,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天呐  你没事吧?
Goddamn! You all right?

1964
01:50:22,140 --> 01:50:24,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈  快起来  我们得出去
Come on, Mom, we gotta get out.

1965
01:50:26,480 --> 01:50:28,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 拿着散弹枪  - 好的
- Take the shotgun. - Okay.

1966
01:50:31,840 --> 01:50:33,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}你受伤了吗?
Are you hurt?

1967
01:50:43,150 --> 01:50:44,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"液化氮"

1968
01:50:46,130 --> 01:50:49,050
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}糟糕  加油  妈
Holy shit. Come on, Mom. Come on!

1969
01:50:49,130 --> 01:50:51,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 我需要你的卡车  - 快
- We need your truck. - Hurry!

1970
01:50:56,840 --> 01:50:59,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 来  快点  - 上车
- Come on. Hurry. - Get in.

1971
01:51:02,350 --> 01:51:03,560
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走
Go!

1972
01:51:09,570 --> 01:51:11,570
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}搞什么
What the hell...

1973
01:51:17,450 --> 01:51:20,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 血止不住  - 继续施压
- I'm bleeding bad. - Keep pressure on it.

1974
01:51:21,870 --> 01:51:23,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这样很奏效
Here. This'll work.

1975
01:51:29,130 --> 01:51:30,840
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}他越来越近了
He's gaining.

1976
01:51:33,350 --> 01:51:34,350
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}加油
Step on it!

1977
01:51:34,400 --> 01:51:37,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 这是最高速了  - 我跑的都比它快
- This is the vehicle's top speed. - I can run faster than this!

1978
