{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走左边
Take the off-ramp.

1982
01:52:38,110 --> 01:52:39,110
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}可恶
Shit!

1983
01:52:42,530 --> 01:52:43,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抓稳了
Hold on!

1984
01:53:29,580 --> 01:53:30,930
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}别停
Don't stop!

1985
01:53:38,720 --> 01:53:40,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}一直走
Go straight!

1986
