{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快离开这儿  快
Get outta here! Let's go! Come on!

1989
01:55:26,710 --> 01:55:29,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>拜拜了  宝贝</i>
<i>Hasta la vista, baby.</i>

1990
01:56:18,770 --> 01:56:20,180
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我们的时间并不多
We don't have much time.

1991
01:56:42,790 --> 01:56:44,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}咱们走
Let's go.

1992
01:56:45,130 --> 01:56:46,920
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快点  我们得离开这儿
Come on! We gotta get outta here.

1993
01:56:47,010 --> 01:56:49,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快点  起来
Come on! Get up!

1994
01:57:02,690 --> 01:57:04,400
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把散弹枪给我
Hand me the shotgun.

1995
01:57:09,240 --> 01:57:11,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈  我扶你走
Put your weight on me, Mom.

1996
01:57:12,320 --> 01:57:13,410
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快呀
Hurry!

1997
01:57:17,790 --> 01:57:19,410
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}忍着点
Come on, Mom.

1998
01:57:25,920 --> 01:57:27,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快起来
Get up!

1999
01:57:43,210 --> 01:57:45,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}走这边
This way. Come on.

2000
01:57:54,100 --> 01:57:55,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  等等
No! Wait!

2001
01:57:56,060 --> 01:57:59,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}等等  太热了  回头
Wait. No. No. It's too hot. Go back.

2002
01:58:08,310 --> 01:58:10,950
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 快跑  - 不  我们得一起走
- Go. Run. - No! We gotta stick together.

2003
01:58:11,040 --> 01:58:13,040
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰  快走
John, you've got to go now.

2004
01:58:13,120 --> 01:58:15,090
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 约翰  - 快走
- John! - Go! Now!

2005
01:58:15,140 --> 01:58:15,990
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No!

2006
01:58:34,560 --> 01:58:37,240
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}"目标搜寻"

2007
01:59:29,740 --> 01:59:31,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}爬上去
Get up the steps.

2008
01:59:33,100 --> 01:59:34,200
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}上去
Go.

2009
01:59:38,920 --> 01:59:40,420
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快
Get up.

2010
01:59:41,210 --> 01:59:43,380
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抓牢  我扶你  快
Come on, Mom. I got you.

2011
