{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抓住链子  抓好
Grab the chain. Grab it.

2012
02:00:21,510 --> 02:00:24,260
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抓住它  快走
Grab it. Go. Go!

2013
02:00:34,600 --> 02:00:37,940
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈  快来啊
Mom, come on! Mom!

2014
