{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把约翰叫来
Call to John.

2015
02:01:30,100 --> 02:01:31,100
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No!

2016
02:01:31,660 --> 02:01:33,540
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我知道这样很痛
I know this hurts.

2017
02:01:35,330 --> 02:01:37,000
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}把他叫来
Call John.

2018
02:01:53,390 --> 02:01:56,060
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}快叫约翰过来
