2027
02:05:33,720 --> 02:05:34,720
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

2028
02:05:35,980 --> 02:05:36,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}约翰
John.

2029
02:05:39,590 --> 02:05:41,170
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈
Mom.

2030
02:05:46,390 --> 02:05:48,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 救我  - 让开  约翰
- Help me. - Get out of the way, John.

2031
02:05:48,810 --> 02:05:49,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}开枪
Shoot!

2032
02:06:33,160 --> 02:06:34,160
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}妈
Mom!

2033
02:06:44,620 --> 02:06:45,740
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}趴下
Get down!

2034
02:08:20,360 --> 02:08:22,530
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}起来  加油
Get up. Come on.

2035
02:08:24,780 --> 02:08:26,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}天呀
Holy shit.

2036
02:08:26,630 --> 02:08:28,630
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我需要疗养
I need a vacation.

2037
02:08:42,340 --> 02:08:45,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它死了吗?
Is it dead?

2038
02:08:45,220 --> 02:08:46,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}被终结掉了
Terminated.

2039
02:08:50,140 --> 02:08:51,810
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这个也丢掉?
Will this melt in there?

2040
02:08:54,770 --> 02:08:56,650
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}对  丢下去
Yes. Throw it in.

2041
02:09:01,070 --> 02:09:02,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}再见
Adios.

2042
02:09:03,740 --> 02:09:05,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}还有晶片
And the chip.

2043
02:09:20,770 --> 02:09:22,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}结束了
It's over.

2044
02:09:24,750 --> 02:09:25,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

2045
02:09:29,310 --> 02:09:30,980
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}还有一个晶片
There's one more chip.

2046
02:09:35,650 --> 02:09:37,900
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}它也得摧毁掉
And it must be destroyed also.

2047
02:09:43,320 --> 02:09:44,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}给
Here.

2048
02:09:45,030 --> 02:09:49,270
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我不能终结我自己  你得把我放到下面的钢水里去
I cannot self-terminate. You must lower me into the steel.

2049
02:09:57,230 --> 02:09:58,230
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No.

2050
02:10:01,550 --> 02:10:04,010
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}抱歉  约翰
I'm sorry, John. I'm sorry.

2051
02:10:04,090 --> 02:10:06,390
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  你留在我们身边不要紧的
No, it'll be okay. Stay with us.

2052
02:10:06,470 --> 02:10:08,470
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 没关系的  - 我必须离开
- It'll be okay. - I have to go away.

2053
02:10:08,560 --> 02:10:11,140
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  别这样  请别走
No, don't do it. Please, don't go.

2054
02:10:11,170 --> 02:10:12,620
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我必须离开
I must go away, John.

2055
02:10:12,670 --> 02:10:13,670
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不
No!

2056
02:10:14,400 --> 02:10:15,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  等等
No, wait.

2057
02:10:15,940 --> 02:10:18,860
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}- 你不必这样做  - 抱歉
- You don't have to do this. - I'm sorry.

2058
02:10:19,780 --> 02:10:22,030
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}不  别这样  别走
No, don't do it! Don't go!

2059
02:10:22,110 --> 02:10:24,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}这一切必须结束
It has to end here.

2060
02:10:25,270 --> 02:10:26,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我命令你不要走
I order you not to go!

2061
02:10:26,970 --> 02:10:28,470
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我命令你不要走
I order you not to go!

2062
02:10:28,570 --> 02:10:29,770
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我命令你不要走
I order you not to go!

2063
02:10:36,450 --> 02:10:38,750
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}我现在知道你们为什么会哭了
I know now why you cry.

2064
02:10:40,970 --> 02:10:43,430
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}但那是我永远做不到的事
But it's something I can never do.

2065
02:11:18,060 --> 02:11:19,640
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}再见
Good-bye.

2066
02:12:12,020 --> 02:12:15,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>不可知的未来在我们面前展开</i>
<i>The unknown future rolls toward us.</i>

2067
02:12:15,150 --> 02:12:19,070
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>我头一次充满希望的面对它</i>
<i>I face it for the first time with a sense of hope.</i>

2068
02:12:19,160 --> 02:12:21,490
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>全因为一台机器  一名终结者</i>
<i>Because if a machine, a Terminator...</i>

2069
02:12:21,570 --> 02:12:24,910
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>它学到了人类生命的价值</i>
<i>can learn the value of human life...</i>

2070
02:12:25,000 --> 02:12:26,660
{\pos(287,265)\fscx50}<i>也许我们也办的到</i>
<i>maybe we can too.</i>


